1
00:02:31,773 --> 00:02:33,308
Let's kill him too, partner.

2
00:02:33,641 --> 00:02:36,144
If we burn everything,
we'll be the prime suspects.

3
00:02:36,644 --> 00:02:38,479
We need a witness
to speak in our favor.

4
00:02:38,980 --> 00:02:39,981
You're right.

5
00:02:40,148 --> 00:02:43,518
But what if he too speaks
only the truth like his father?

6
00:02:44,152 --> 00:02:45,820
Let's find out right away.

7
00:02:45,987 --> 00:02:47,689
Boy, what's your name?

8
00:02:48,389 --> 00:02:49,891
- Bhavani
- Huh?

9
00:02:50,892 --> 00:02:51,726
Bhavani.

10
00:02:51,893 --> 00:02:53,228
How did your parents die?

11
00:02:56,731 --> 00:02:58,933
They were burnt to death
in a gas cylinder explosion.

12
00:03:02,737 --> 00:03:04,105
He sure knows to survive.

13
00:03:04,305 --> 00:03:06,140
After using him as a witness,

14
00:03:06,307 --> 00:03:08,643
let's file a fake complaint saying
he stole our union funds.

15
00:03:08,810 --> 00:03:10,311
His father was a Lorry Union leader.

16
00:03:10,445 --> 00:03:12,814
Nobody would believe
that he stole union funds.

17
00:03:13,147 --> 00:03:15,016
So compassionate all of a sudden?

18
00:03:15,149 --> 00:03:16,684
He's so young, that's why.

19
00:03:17,018 --> 00:03:18,686
Boy, listen.

20
00:03:20,021 --> 00:03:22,857
I'll send you to a place where they will
take good care of boys like you.

21
00:03:22,891 --> 00:03:23,858
Will you go there?

22
00:03:27,362 --> 00:03:29,898
GOVT. JUVENILE OBSERVATION HOME
NAGERCOIL, KALLAKURICHI

23
00:03:32,233 --> 00:03:34,769
<i>That boy shouldn't sleep
peacefully even for a night.</i>

24
00:03:35,436 --> 00:03:36,971
There's more than
what you asked for.

25
00:03:37,105 --> 00:03:38,106
Thank you, sir.

26
00:03:38,306 --> 00:03:41,476
If there's any foul play,
Esakki will kill you both.

27
00:03:41,809 --> 00:03:43,278
- Better keep an eye.
- I will, sir.

28
00:03:49,517 --> 00:03:50,652
Hey, come here.

29
00:03:51,519 --> 00:03:52,520
What are you glaring at him for?

30
00:03:56,891 --> 00:03:59,694
Get up! How dare you sleep!

31
00:04:04,766 --> 00:04:05,767
What are you looking at?

32
00:04:05,900 --> 00:04:06,734
Clean.

33
00:04:07,101 --> 00:04:07,936
Wipe my boots!

34
00:04:10,438 --> 00:04:11,439
I'll flay you, rascal!

35
00:04:15,810 --> 00:04:16,811
Move aside, everybody.

36
00:04:30,391 --> 00:04:32,560
I've been beating you up
like an animal,

37
00:04:33,394 --> 00:04:36,231
but you don't seem
to be affected at all.

38
00:04:36,397 --> 00:04:38,266
You are hitting me mercilessly
because someone is paying you.

39
00:04:38,933 --> 00:04:41,936
I have to pay you more
to make you stop hitting me.

40
00:04:42,770 --> 00:04:44,606
I am penniless.
Hit me as long as you want.

41
00:04:44,939 --> 00:04:47,475
When I have the money,
I'll call you up.

42
00:05:03,391 --> 00:05:04,559
- Who is this?
- <i>Sir</i>...

43
00:05:04,893 --> 00:05:06,728
<i>Bhavani has escaped from jail.</i>

44
00:05:06,895 --> 00:05:08,897
Is this why
I'm spending so lavishly?

45
00:05:09,898 --> 00:05:12,767
I'll deal with you in person.
Find him before daybreak.

46
00:05:14,269 --> 00:05:15,103
Scumbag!

47
00:05:29,150 --> 00:05:29,984
Don't be scared, sir.

48
00:05:30,685 --> 00:05:31,653
I won't harm you.

49
00:05:32,186 --> 00:05:35,290
I could have slit your throat
while you were asleep, you know.

50
00:05:35,356 --> 00:05:38,059
But I can't be on the run
throughout my life.

51
00:05:38,893 --> 00:05:41,062
I came here to request you
to let me lead a normal life.

52
00:05:41,396 --> 00:05:42,230
I'm not following.

53
00:05:45,099 --> 00:05:46,267
Let me live, sir.

54
00:05:46,601 --> 00:05:48,836
What do I gain by releasing you, huh?

55
00:05:48,937 --> 00:05:50,772
Let me out for a week, sir.

56
00:05:51,272 --> 00:05:53,808
I'll give you half of
what I earn in this time.

57
00:05:53,975 --> 00:05:55,710
If I miss a week,

58
00:05:55,810 --> 00:05:57,478
stab me to death.

59
00:05:57,979 --> 00:05:59,647
Fine, I'll take a chance on you.

60
00:06:00,315 --> 00:06:02,183
This week is yours, go.

61
00:06:05,186 --> 00:06:08,723
How much do you usually pay for a lorry
to cross the check post without a permit?

62
00:06:08,857 --> 00:06:11,459
You've to cough up Rs 1000 per lorry
to be allowed to pass.

63
00:06:11,559 --> 00:06:13,294
I'll get the permit slip.

64
00:06:13,394 --> 00:06:15,063
Rs 1000 is yours to keep.

65
00:06:15,396 --> 00:06:16,898
I just want Rs 100 per lorry.

66
00:06:17,398 --> 00:06:18,933
What if the police interferes?

67
00:06:21,936 --> 00:06:23,438
That's my responsibility.

68
00:06:32,981 --> 00:06:35,183
What is it? What do you want?

69
00:06:48,062 --> 00:06:50,064
'2002-2003 Register'

70
00:06:58,773 --> 00:07:00,308
Go, go, go.

71
00:07:02,477 --> 00:07:03,478
Move, move.

72
00:07:04,646 --> 00:07:05,547
Come, quick

73
00:07:05,647 --> 00:07:07,148
Hey! Wait, wait.

74
00:07:07,982 --> 00:07:08,983
Hurry up.

75
00:07:14,022 --> 00:07:16,457
If you want the permit slip in your hand,

76
00:07:16,558 --> 00:07:18,393
I must get Rs 500 per lorry.

77
00:07:20,562 --> 00:07:21,396
Got it?

78
00:07:44,519 --> 00:07:45,587
Whether I'm here or not,

79
00:07:45,687 --> 00:07:48,056
ensure the boys get
their share of booze and fag.

80
00:07:52,894 --> 00:07:54,562
GOVT. REFORMATORY

81
00:08:23,024 --> 00:08:25,026
In a way, we are
responsible for all this, partner.

82
00:08:25,727 --> 00:08:28,563
When we killed his father,
we should have burnt him to ashes too

83
00:08:29,230 --> 00:08:34,269
Now he's running for the president
of the Lorry Drivers' Union.

84
00:08:35,603 --> 00:08:37,105
How did he amass
so much wealth, sir?

85
00:08:38,606 --> 00:08:42,110
Logu, do you know how many
lorries are under his control?

86
00:08:42,977 --> 00:08:45,113
He also owns a meat factory.

87
00:08:45,146 --> 00:08:46,314
He is into exports too.

88
00:08:47,015 --> 00:08:49,183
But this isn't news, partner.

89
00:08:49,984 --> 00:08:52,086
You know this reformatory
for juvenile delinquents?

90
00:08:52,186 --> 00:08:54,689
He uses those boys to do something.
That's where the money flows in.

91
00:08:55,190 --> 00:08:57,392
Some even say he plays proxy
to the minister to launder money.

92
00:08:58,226 --> 00:09:00,895
If he wins this year's Union Election,

93
00:09:02,063 --> 00:09:04,732
he will definitely avenge
his father's death.

94
00:09:05,767 --> 00:09:07,769
We must act now, partner.

95
00:09:20,982 --> 00:09:21,816
There he is.

96
00:09:22,183 --> 00:09:23,184
Finish him.

97
00:09:45,440 --> 00:09:48,476
You've got Gods of Hindu,
Muslim, Christian

98
00:09:48,610 --> 00:09:50,378
dangling around your neck, why?

99
00:09:50,478 --> 00:09:51,813
I pray to all Gods, you see.

100
00:09:52,313 --> 00:09:54,015
At least, one will save me
when I'm in danger.

101
00:09:54,349 --> 00:09:55,516
Minimum guarantee.

102
00:09:55,683 --> 00:09:56,517
Philosophy?

103
00:09:57,518 --> 00:10:01,389
Is he the same chap who pleaded
for his life at the age of 17?

104
00:10:04,726 --> 00:10:06,394
We need to discuss something
very important with you.

105
00:10:06,728 --> 00:10:08,730
You've been paying us
on a weekly basis all these years, right?

106
00:10:09,063 --> 00:10:09,898
You can stop that.

107
00:10:10,398 --> 00:10:13,101
Instead sell all your assets

108
00:10:13,601 --> 00:10:15,103
and earn a living
somewhere outside this town.

109
00:10:16,104 --> 00:10:17,639
I wanted to talk about this
next week.

110
00:10:18,106 --> 00:10:21,809
How long can I keep paying you
money every week?

111
00:10:21,976 --> 00:10:23,645
I've decided not to pay.

112
00:10:23,811 --> 00:10:28,349
Hey. That decision isn't yours to take,
scumbag!

113
00:10:28,683 --> 00:10:30,518
Just shut up and obey our orders.

114
00:10:30,685 --> 00:10:32,420
I do what I feel is right.

115
00:10:32,520 --> 00:10:33,354
Well...

116
00:10:34,022 --> 00:10:36,024
I'm aware how dirty your hands are.

117
00:10:36,691 --> 00:10:38,893
Making those boys surrender
for the crimes you commit.

118
00:10:39,060 --> 00:10:41,396
Instigating them to kill.
We know all about your business.

119
00:10:41,729 --> 00:10:44,065
Don't show off your temerity.
Just tuck your tail and scoot.

120
00:10:44,599 --> 00:10:46,267
Otherwise, we will kill you.

121
00:10:51,439 --> 00:10:53,608
Look around. This is my area.

122
00:10:53,641 --> 00:10:57,312
I can get you killed right now.

123
00:10:57,812 --> 00:11:01,316
I think you are unable to differentiate
working for money and for loyalty?

124
00:11:02,016 --> 00:11:03,184
Shall I demonstrate?

125
00:11:07,188 --> 00:11:09,724
Listen! We have an important
work to do, come here.

126
00:11:11,025 --> 00:11:12,360
He is calling us, come.

127
00:11:13,862 --> 00:11:15,897
- Bhavani.
- Why is he calling us suddenly?

128
00:11:18,733 --> 00:11:22,103
Whoever kills these three men
right here will be rewarded

129
00:11:22,604 --> 00:11:23,938
with a prize money

130
00:11:25,273 --> 00:11:26,441
of 20 lakh rupees.

131
00:11:31,479 --> 00:11:33,681
Do you realize where you are
and what you are blabbering?

132
00:11:33,815 --> 00:11:35,516
Do you think I'm with him
for money?

133
00:11:35,817 --> 00:11:37,185
We go back a long way.

134
00:11:37,352 --> 00:11:39,320
- 30 lakh rupees.
- It doesn't matter!

135
00:11:39,354 --> 00:11:41,356
- He's like my brother.
- 40 lakh rupees.

136
00:11:41,389 --> 00:11:43,691
Sir, why are you letting him talk?

137
00:11:43,725 --> 00:11:44,792
Just say yes, I'll kill him--

138
00:11:44,893 --> 00:11:46,027
50 lakh rupees.

139
00:11:47,862 --> 00:11:49,831
- How dare you rattle off?
- 60 lakh rupees.

140
00:11:49,898 --> 00:11:51,432
Hey! Kill him!

141
00:11:51,566 --> 00:11:53,768
Wait, sir, let's hear him out.

142
00:11:54,736 --> 00:11:55,770
70 lakh rupees.

143
00:11:56,104 --> 00:11:57,772
- Hey--
- It's all right, sir.

144
00:11:57,805 --> 00:12:00,708
Sir, I'll go watch the gate
and make sure no one enters.

145
00:12:00,808 --> 00:12:02,544
- 80 lakh rupees.
- What!

146
00:12:02,644 --> 00:12:03,478
Move aside.

147
00:12:07,482 --> 00:12:09,250
Then shall we lock
the deal for 80 lakh rupees?

148
00:12:09,350 --> 00:12:10,518
- Okay, sir.
- Are you ready?

149
00:12:10,685 --> 00:12:13,021
We will divide 80 lakh equally.
I'll deal with these three men.

150
00:12:18,226 --> 00:12:21,396
Now do you know the difference
between greed and gratitude?

151
00:12:23,064 --> 00:12:23,898
Sir.

152
00:12:31,105 --> 00:12:32,040
I don't need this.

153
00:12:32,106 --> 00:12:33,641
I'll give you two minutes.

154
00:12:33,942 --> 00:12:38,479
Kill me if you can
and save your lives.

155
00:12:55,196 --> 00:12:55,930
Hey!

156
00:12:58,733 --> 00:12:59,567
Hey!

157
00:13:34,269 --> 00:13:35,103
These boys?

158
00:13:35,737 --> 00:13:36,571
Yes, sir.

159
00:13:38,106 --> 00:13:40,441
Post mortem matches the crime scene?

160
00:13:40,775 --> 00:13:41,976
They have done a neat job, sir.

161
00:13:42,310 --> 00:13:44,779
Not knowing to drive
they ran over a man.

162
00:13:44,812 --> 00:13:46,180
You expect me to buy this?

163
00:13:46,314 --> 00:13:47,815
Whom are you trying to trick?

164
00:13:47,982 --> 00:13:49,851
Sir, I'm not a professional driver.

165
00:13:49,984 --> 00:13:52,020
I was just trying to drive
and there was an accident.

166
00:13:52,186 --> 00:13:53,521
- Right?
- Yes, sir.

167
00:13:54,722 --> 00:13:57,192
- Do they have a past history?
- Yes, sir.

168
00:13:57,225 --> 00:13:58,693
Pickpocket case, 511.

169
00:13:58,726 --> 00:14:01,062
Then they were in a govt. reformatory
for six months.

170
00:14:01,196 --> 00:14:02,764
Now they are facing
charges under IPC 302.

171
00:14:03,398 --> 00:14:04,599
Is this a reformatory?

172
00:14:04,732 --> 00:14:06,067
Or a criminal training centre?

173
00:14:06,901 --> 00:14:09,437
Why do you need this reformatory
that turns a thief into a murderer?

174
00:14:10,104 --> 00:14:12,273
- Call the Observation home staff.
- Okay, sir.

175
00:14:12,807 --> 00:14:14,309
Sir, he wants to see you.

176
00:14:15,810 --> 00:14:18,046
Greetings, sir.
I am the superintendent here.

177
00:14:18,146 --> 00:14:21,015
Forget the introduction, when do you
intend on employing a regular master?

178
00:14:21,182 --> 00:14:24,018
The boys drive away
any master we appoint.

179
00:14:24,152 --> 00:14:26,855
Actually scared of them,
no teacher wants to take up this post.

180
00:14:27,021 --> 00:14:28,022
But how can you run a school?

181
00:14:28,189 --> 00:14:29,891
Not one teacher so far, huh?

182
00:14:30,391 --> 00:14:31,893
Shocking and shameful!

183
00:14:33,194 --> 00:14:36,331
If there's no master to teach
or guide the students,

184
00:14:36,397 --> 00:14:38,099
how will they reform, huh?

185
00:14:38,399 --> 00:14:41,236
I have personally seen
about 40 cases like this here.

186
00:14:41,936 --> 00:14:43,771
Superintendent, I'm passing a govt. order.

187
00:14:43,938 --> 00:14:47,475
Send it to all private, govt. schools
and colleges, to every single institution

188
00:14:47,642 --> 00:14:48,643
in Tamil Nadu.

189
00:14:48,943 --> 00:14:50,945
You'll find a master
for sure, understand?

190
00:14:51,646 --> 00:14:52,814
Type out the order.

191
00:15:00,722 --> 00:15:03,391
<i>They call me master
Changes will happen faster</i>

192
00:15:05,226 --> 00:15:08,563
MASTER

193
00:15:10,398 --> 00:15:11,332
<i>His entry spells power</i>

194
00:15:11,432 --> 00:15:12,767
<i>Who is our master?
Commander</i>

195
00:15:12,901 --> 00:15:15,770
<i>St Jeffery College is a truly renowned
educational institution in Chennai.</i>

196
00:15:15,904 --> 00:15:17,772
<i>Alumni of this college
have carved a name</i>

197
00:15:17,805 --> 00:15:21,809
in cinema, politics, advertising and
are celebrities in their own right.

198
00:15:21,976 --> 00:15:24,312
This college has molded innumerable VIPs.

199
00:15:24,479 --> 00:15:30,151
Students are very eager to make this
a very memorable reunion.

200
00:15:30,351 --> 00:15:32,487
Do you want to know why?
Come along with me.

201
00:15:35,390 --> 00:15:36,724
- Hi. Ramya.
- Yes.

202
00:15:36,891 --> 00:15:38,693
- Hi, nice to meet you.
- Same here.

203
00:15:38,726 --> 00:15:40,061
I spoke to you over the phone.

204
00:15:40,395 --> 00:15:41,563
- Oh! That was you?
- Yeah.

205
00:15:41,696 --> 00:15:42,430
Okay, okay.

206
00:15:42,897 --> 00:15:44,933
- What's your full name?
- Charulatha Prasad.

207
00:15:45,099 --> 00:15:47,435
- Nice. I'll introduce you to everyone.
- Sure.

208
00:15:47,602 --> 00:15:50,538
- This college has a decorum.
- Students are capable of doing it.

209
00:15:50,605 --> 00:15:53,641
Their plan is to ruin our image when
the minister arrives as our chief guest.

210
00:15:53,808 --> 00:15:55,643
If this issue leaks,
your college reputation will be at stake.

211
00:15:55,777 --> 00:15:56,644
Take a seat.

212
00:15:56,778 --> 00:15:58,446
If you want to take further action

213
00:15:58,479 --> 00:16:00,682
- do so after the minister leaves.
- This is well planned.

214
00:16:00,815 --> 00:16:02,650
Sri, stop this cat and mouse game.

215
00:16:02,684 --> 00:16:05,019
- You better confess the truth.
- Trust me, sir.

216
00:16:05,186 --> 00:16:06,855
- Isn't JD responsible?
- No, sir.

217
00:16:06,988 --> 00:16:08,022
I swear, no, sir.

218
00:16:08,189 --> 00:16:10,225
Then who is the culprit?
Your father?

219
00:16:11,059 --> 00:16:12,694
Everyone knows about Savitha's trauma.

220
00:16:12,727 --> 00:16:14,796
I know how those two scumbags
sexually harassed her--

221
00:16:14,896 --> 00:16:15,763
Hey! Mind your words.

222
00:16:16,397 --> 00:16:17,232
Spit that gum out first.

223
00:16:19,767 --> 00:16:20,768
I said throw it out.

224
00:16:20,902 --> 00:16:22,670
I'll trash it as soon as
it loses its sweetness.

225
00:16:22,770 --> 00:16:23,771
Don't act smart.

226
00:16:24,272 --> 00:16:26,541
The two noble souls
who sexually harassed her,

227
00:16:26,641 --> 00:16:27,809
were suspended by you for one week.

228
00:16:27,942 --> 00:16:29,811
Knowing it was inadequate,
we even complained to the police.

229
00:16:29,978 --> 00:16:32,747
But they took us for a ride
without taking any action.

230
00:16:32,814 --> 00:16:35,016
Only then did we come know
that Aadith's dad is a rich businessman.

231
00:16:35,149 --> 00:16:37,518
I think he has planned
to send them off to Canada.

232
00:16:37,652 --> 00:16:39,354
That's why I took the boys

233
00:16:39,487 --> 00:16:41,189
<i>to his house
to find out his plan.</i>

234
00:16:43,391 --> 00:16:45,627
<i>Hello, sir, they haven't
left the house yet.</i>

235
00:16:45,727 --> 00:16:46,895
<i>I think they are still inside.</i>

236
00:16:47,061 --> 00:16:49,397
<i>But it's evident they have
hatched a plot to escape.</i>

237
00:16:49,731 --> 00:16:51,933
<i>Strangers are walking
in and out of their house.</i>

238
00:16:52,600 --> 00:16:54,736
Sir, I can hear their voices.
I think they are coming out.

239
00:16:54,769 --> 00:16:56,337
- Take care, Son.
- Don't worry, Dad.

240
00:16:56,437 --> 00:16:58,306
- Be safe.
- I'll call as soon as I reach.

241
00:16:58,806 --> 00:17:00,275
This is the duo.

242
00:17:00,308 --> 00:17:01,643
Call after you reach the airport.

243
00:17:01,809 --> 00:17:02,810
Go, go, go.

244
00:17:03,645 --> 00:17:04,812
Let's follow them.

245
00:17:06,814 --> 00:17:08,816
Both of them have left home, sir.

246
00:17:09,017 --> 00:17:11,352
Aadith and Rahul are in a taxi.
They just crossed Ashok Nagar.

247
00:17:11,486 --> 00:17:13,354
<i>Along with our boys,
I am following them, sir.</i>

248
00:17:13,688 --> 00:17:15,223
- Where are you, sir?
- At a signal.

249
00:17:15,356 --> 00:17:17,525
- Which signal?
