someone else to surrender.

1241
01:14:13,441 --> 01:14:15,710
Not wanting to surrender
isn't a mistake on your part,

1242
01:14:15,810 --> 01:14:17,779
but you wanted to sneak out
our internal information.

1243
01:14:17,979 --> 01:14:19,147
Isn't that a grave mistake?

1244
01:14:20,815 --> 01:14:22,984
Grown-up boy, you tell me
what you did was wrong or not?

1245
01:14:23,017 --> 01:14:24,686
- Yes, it was wrong.
- So I am right?

1246
01:14:27,021 --> 01:14:28,523
Enough of eating biriyani.

1247
01:14:28,857 --> 01:14:31,226
I'll take it. You've had enough.

1248
01:14:31,392 --> 01:14:32,393
Here, take this.

1249
01:14:32,560 --> 01:14:34,863
Aren't we both very young, sir?

1250
01:14:34,896 --> 01:14:37,565
Think of us as your younger brother
and please forgive us this time.

1251
01:14:37,899 --> 01:14:40,435
My dear, only boys like you
should not be pardoned.

1252
01:14:41,069 --> 01:14:43,271
They pardoned me.
Look how it has shaped me.

1253
01:14:44,439 --> 01:14:45,640
How do we deal with this?

1254
01:14:45,773 --> 01:14:48,142
We won't repeat this, sir.
We won't snitch to anyone.

1255
01:14:48,309 --> 01:14:49,143
Well...

1256
01:14:49,978 --> 01:14:52,847
Listen, you can be scared
of anyone in this world

1257
01:14:53,147 --> 01:14:54,849
but if death knocks at our door,

1258
01:14:55,683 --> 01:14:58,186
even if it is Lord Yama,
you shouldn't be scared.

1259
01:14:59,854 --> 01:15:00,855
I'll give you two minutes.

1260
01:15:01,389 --> 01:15:04,392
Kill me and then save
your brother and yourself.

1261
01:15:07,228 --> 01:15:09,731
What were you doing
when these kids stole your phone?

1262
01:15:10,231 --> 01:15:12,000
On top of it, you have
this stuck up attitude!

1263
01:15:12,100 --> 01:15:13,601
- Go away.
- I won't leave you.

1264
01:15:13,768 --> 01:15:15,236
Listen to me.
Just run away.

1265
01:15:15,603 --> 01:15:16,604
- Run outside.
- I won't go.

1266
01:15:16,771 --> 01:15:18,940
You mess up everything.
Only plus is your voice!

1267
01:15:19,107 --> 01:15:19,974
- Go!
- I won't.

1268
01:15:20,108 --> 01:15:21,776
You have only one minute left.

1269
01:15:21,809 --> 01:15:22,810
Decide fast.

1270
01:15:22,977 --> 01:15:23,878
Go away from here.

1271
01:15:23,978 --> 01:15:26,314
I won't leave you alone.

1272
01:15:35,857 --> 01:15:36,891
What are you doing?

1273
01:15:39,894 --> 01:15:41,563
This is what I expected from you!

1274
01:15:43,064 --> 01:15:44,232
Clear out.

1275
01:15:44,265 --> 01:15:45,567
I won't leave you.

1276
01:15:54,976 --> 01:15:57,312
Brother!

1277
01:15:58,446 --> 01:16:00,315
Wake up, sir. Get up.

1278
01:16:00,348 --> 01:16:02,917
I'm constable Arumugam.
Get up, sir.

1279
01:16:03,017 --> 01:16:05,587
School starts only at 10 o'clock.
Why are you waking me--

1280
01:16:05,687 --> 01:16:07,889
We have a problem on hand.
Inspector wants to see you.

1281
01:16:08,022 --> 01:16:09,791
- Hurry up!
- Why should I meet the inspector?

1282
01:16:09,891 --> 01:16:12,293
You have to get up now.
There's a big problem.

1283
01:16:12,393 --> 01:16:13,728
Okay, I'll get up.

1284
01:16:13,862 --> 01:16:15,396
Don't shake me up like a rattle!

1285
01:16:16,064 --> 01:16:17,398
Go, I'll follow.

1286
01:16:18,766 --> 01:16:19,934
I will come.

1287
01:16:28,643 --> 01:16:29,611
Start... make it quick.

1288
01:16:57,605 --> 01:17:02,644
<i>If delinquents like us lament in pain
Will our voice be heard or is it in vain?</i>

1289
01:17:03,645 --> 01:17:04,812
Not too sure, sir.

1290
01:17:04,979 --> 01:17:06,681
I think they were here
for less than a year.

1291
01:17:07,682 --> 01:17:12,687
<i>Two innocent boys here
Lost their lives so dear</i>

1292
01:17:13,021 --> 01:17:16,291
<i>To reside here or hang by a rope
One and the same without hope</i>

1293
01:17:16,391 --> 01:17:18,059
What are you gawking at, huh?

1294
01:17:18,226 --> 01:17:19,294
Hey! Who are you?

1295
01:17:19,394 --> 01:17:20,528
- Get out.
- Sir, sir.

1296
01:17:20,562 --> 01:17:21,963
He is our class master.

1297
01:17:22,063 --> 01:17:24,999
Oh! You are that master, huh?
First I have to interrogate you.

1298
01:17:25,099 --> 01:17:26,234
What did you do?

1299
01:17:26,267 --> 01:17:27,769
This has never happened before.

1300
01:17:27,902 --> 01:17:29,170
Did you hit any of the boys?

1301
01:17:29,270 --> 01:17:30,271
Tell me.

1302
01:17:30,305 --> 01:17:31,940
Can't you hear me?
Answer me, man.

1303
01:17:33,641 --> 01:17:35,977
Sir, what is this?

1304
01:17:36,110 --> 01:17:37,779
Not here, I need to
take him for inquiry.

1305
01:17:37,812 --> 01:17:39,814
- Get him into our police jeep.
- Come, sir.

1306
01:17:39,847 --> 01:17:43,184
Search all the rooms in case
they left any suicide note.

1307
01:17:43,651 --> 01:17:47,689
<i>We want to reform given a choice
We are good-for-nothing boys</i>

1308
01:17:48,189 --> 01:17:53,228
<i>If delinquents like us lament in pain
Will our voice be heard or is it in vain?</i>

1309
01:17:58,399 --> 01:18:03,938
<i>If good-for-nothing louts wail
Will our voice make justice prevail?</i>

1310
01:18:06,307 --> 01:18:09,143
N2 POLICE STATION
VADASERI

1311
01:18:17,518 --> 01:18:20,154
Bhavani, can we come with you?

1312
01:18:20,688 --> 01:18:22,557
He has asked me to come
alone, I can handle it.

1313
01:18:23,024 --> 01:18:25,560
What about that master
who is in the police custody?

1314
01:18:28,062 --> 01:18:30,398
I came out of the reformatory
15 years ago.

1315
01:18:30,598 --> 01:18:32,333
The reason I've been patient
for the past five years is

1316
01:18:32,433 --> 01:18:33,935
because I want to kill
these three men

1317
01:18:34,068 --> 01:18:36,170
and become the president
of the drivers' union.

1318
01:18:36,271 --> 01:18:39,107
Two men are dead and gone.
He's the only one left.

1319
01:18:39,140 --> 01:18:40,308
He wants to see me.

1320
01:18:40,975 --> 01:18:42,277
Is he my priority?

1321
01:18:42,977 --> 01:18:44,312
Or is this master important?

1322
01:18:44,779 --> 01:18:45,813
He's important.

1323
01:18:45,980 --> 01:18:47,982
- What shall we do with this master?
- I'll handle him.

1324
01:18:48,016 --> 01:18:50,018
- Sure?
- No problem.

1325
01:18:50,184 --> 01:18:52,020
- Shall I go now?
- Okay. I'll go too.

1326
01:18:53,021 --> 01:18:54,022
Let's go.

1327
01:19:00,562 --> 01:19:01,729
Come with me.

1328
01:19:09,938 --> 01:19:10,872
Where are you going?

1329
01:19:10,939 --> 01:19:13,308
- Two minutes, sir.
- Quick. Sir will be here anytime.

1330
01:19:13,608 --> 01:19:15,310
Are you the mother of
those two boys who died?

1331
01:19:15,476 --> 01:19:17,312
- Yes, sir.
- Is that so?

1332
01:19:17,645 --> 01:19:19,047
Give him all the details--

1333
01:19:19,147 --> 01:19:20,315
You are completely drunk, right?

1334
01:19:20,348 --> 01:19:23,017
- Sit outside.
- Okay, sir.

1335
01:19:23,851 --> 01:19:25,987
If someone is calling you
ten times from the same number,

1336
01:19:26,020 --> 01:19:28,189
won't it occur to you that
there may be a serious problem?

1337
01:19:28,356 --> 01:19:30,191
No, Ch... Charu.

1338
01:19:31,192 --> 01:19:32,360
Why do you look blank?

1339
01:19:32,393 --> 01:19:35,830
I was a volunteer in an NGO
before I took up this post here.

1340
01:19:35,897 --> 01:19:39,234
Based on a complaint, I went to
inspect the Observation Home.

1341
01:19:39,734 --> 01:19:41,769
That's how I befriended those two boys.

1342
01:19:43,104 --> 01:19:45,607
They told me about the injustice
in that reformatory.

1343
01:19:46,107 --> 01:19:48,776
But I couldn't take
any legal action.

1344
01:19:48,810 --> 01:19:50,044
So many vile threats.

1345
01:19:50,144 --> 01:19:52,146
The only reason I shifted to Chennai
was to handle such cases myself.

1346
01:19:53,014 --> 01:19:56,184
I needed to be financially secure.
So I took up this lecturer's post.

1347
01:19:57,018 --> 01:20:00,321
When you defended the students,
my faith was recharged.

1348
01:20:01,055 --> 01:20:03,558
I was convinced this flawed system
could be changed for the better.

1349
01:20:06,394 --> 01:20:08,363
I forged your signature for this post.

1350
01:20:08,396 --> 01:20:10,598
I was the one who applied
for this job on your behalf.

1351
01:20:11,065 --> 01:20:12,600
Even the founder is aware of this.

1352
01:20:12,901 --> 01:20:14,602
Now I feel that was a big mistake.

1353
01:20:16,771 --> 01:20:20,308
If you hadn't come here,
at least those two boys would be alive.

1354
01:20:22,310 --> 01:20:24,112
Now both of them have left us.

1355
01:20:24,312 --> 01:20:25,847
How can you defend yourself, sir?

1356
01:20:31,019 --> 01:20:34,756
See, I had no idea whatsoever.
No one told me anything.

1357
01:20:34,856 --> 01:20:36,724
When have you been
sober enough to understand?

1358
01:20:37,058 --> 01:20:39,894
Have you ever realized anytime
who is talking to you?

1359
01:20:44,065 --> 01:20:46,100
I have my share of personal problems.

1360
01:20:46,234 --> 01:20:48,269
I am unable to come out of it.

1361
01:20:48,903 --> 01:20:49,938
I can't...

1362
01:20:50,605 --> 01:20:51,773
...cry.

1363
01:20:52,473 --> 01:20:55,143
I can't cry, I can't sleep
at night either, that's why

1364
01:20:58,646 --> 01:20:59,681
I drink.

1365
01:20:59,814 --> 01:21:03,017
I swear I never thought
it would be this horrific.

1366
01:21:03,851 --> 01:21:05,853
Oh! You can never cry, right?

1367
01:21:06,688 --> 01:21:08,356
I can't understand.
Tell me without crying.

1368
01:21:08,389 --> 01:21:09,624
Charu, where are you--

1369
01:21:09,724 --> 01:21:12,727
- Were your boys into drugs?
- I never thought I would see them dead.

1370
01:21:12,861 --> 01:21:14,896
This is the lady who gave birth
to those boys who are dead now.

1371
01:21:15,563 --> 01:21:16,931
I had reassured her.

1372
01:21:17,065 --> 01:21:18,099
A master will come.

1373
01:21:18,266 --> 01:21:19,934
He will save your boys.

1374
01:21:21,069 --> 01:21:24,973
Both my sons were very fond of each other.
They were inseparable.

1375
01:21:25,940 --> 01:21:28,142
My eldest told me
this just last week.

1376
01:21:28,476 --> 01:21:31,980
Let my younger brother study,
I'll find some job to support us.

1377
01:21:32,647 --> 01:21:33,982
A master was coming he said.

1378
01:21:34,015 --> 01:21:36,684
He was sure they will be rescued.

1379
01:21:37,018 --> 01:21:38,686
But no one came.

1380
01:21:39,153 --> 01:21:41,890
My entire lineage has snapped.

1381
01:21:42,557 --> 01:21:44,225
Where are you?

1382
01:21:44,392 --> 01:21:45,527
Hurry up.

1383
01:21:46,394 --> 01:21:47,395
Listen to him.

1384
01:21:48,062 --> 01:21:48,897
Bring your wife.

1385
01:21:49,230 --> 01:21:51,599
- Come here.
- You can go.

1386
01:21:52,233 --> 01:21:53,434
He has gone back to his old ways.

1387
01:21:53,902 --> 01:21:55,770
- Sir.
- Who are they?

1388
01:21:56,104 --> 01:21:57,939
She is master's colleague
from the college.

1389
01:21:58,439 --> 01:22:00,475
Pack them all off and
move that master to the cell.

1390
01:22:00,608 --> 01:22:01,476
Okay, sir.

1391
01:22:01,643 --> 01:22:03,878
Clear the other cases
out of the station.

1392
01:22:03,978 --> 01:22:04,946
Okay, sir.

1393
01:22:04,979 --> 01:22:06,147
What will I do now?

1394
01:22:07,315 --> 01:22:08,850
How will I live without them?

1395
01:22:09,017 --> 01:22:10,685
You're still unable
to shed tears even?

1396
01:22:10,852 --> 01:22:12,520
Your eyes won't shed tears
till the day you die.

1397
01:22:13,021 --> 01:22:14,289
Get even more sloshed.

1398
01:22:14,355 --> 01:22:16,558
Why are you lamenting here?
Shut up now.

1399
01:22:17,058 --> 01:22:18,226
I said shut up.

1400
01:22:18,726 --> 01:22:21,229
Do I have to repeat myself?
Clear this place now, madam.

1401
01:22:21,696 --> 01:22:22,730
Clear out.

1402
01:22:23,064 --> 01:22:23,731
Come with me, sir.

1403
01:22:24,933 --> 01:22:25,934
I swear--

1404
01:22:26,067 --> 01:22:28,269
Come along, sir.
Standing rooted to the spot.

1405
01:22:28,436 --> 01:22:30,438
- I swear I didn't expect any of this.
- Remember this.

1406
01:22:30,605 --> 01:22:33,474
Don't forget you are also responsible
for the death of those two boys.

1407
01:22:33,608 --> 01:22:35,043
Convey my apologies to their mother.

1408
01:22:35,143 --> 01:22:37,779
You are taking undue advantage
of the respect I'm giving you.

1409
01:22:37,979 --> 01:22:39,547
Don't make me lose my temper.
Stand right there.

1410
01:22:39,647 --> 01:22:40,815
Go in.

1411
01:22:40,848 --> 01:22:42,984
I sacrificed my children
in such an awful unjust way.

1412
01:22:43,017 --> 01:22:44,319
Hey! Come here.

1413
01:22:45,186 --> 01:22:47,689
Sir, please light an incense stick.
There are mosquitoes here.

1414
01:22:55,063 --> 01:22:56,397
Go inside.

1415
01:23:22,357 --> 01:23:23,391
Listen, Bhavani.

1416
01:23:24,225 --> 01:23:27,862
Only you and I are left to contest
the Lorry Drivers' Union election.

1417
01:23:28,396 --> 01:23:29,964
I have to win unopposed.

1418
01:23:30,064 --> 01:23:31,499
Looks like it may rain.

1419
01:23:31,599 --> 01:23:33,268
Can we have tea
and then discuss?

1420
01:24:00,862 --> 01:24:02,897
<i>Master, my name is Sabari.</i>

1421
01:24:03,398 --> 01:24:04,933
<i>My elder brother is Manikandan.</i>

1422
01:24:05,433 --> 01:24:09,270
<i>He stole from a bakery for my sake
because I was starving.</i>

1423
01:24:09,604 --> 01:24:12,974
<i>But they foisted some other case
on us and brought us here.</i>

1424
01:24:13,808 --> 01:24:15,476
<i>Everything is wrong here, master.</i>

1425
01:24:15,977 --> 01:24:17,145
<i>They thrash us mercilessly.</i>

1426
01:24:17,979 --> 01:24:19,981
<i>They stuff some powder into our mouths.</i>

1427
01:24:20,648 --> 01:24:24,152
<i>Immediately even our teeth
start shivering, Master.</i>

1428
01:24:24,852 --> 01:24:27,188
<i>Don't know if it is day or night.</i>

1429
01:24:27,856 --> 01:24:30,525
<i>We put up with all this
thinking it is for a short period.</i>

1430
01:24:31,059 --> 01:24:32,527
<i>Now when we are
about to be released,</i>

1431
01:24:32,694 --> 01:24:34,729
<i>they want us to surrender
for some other murder case.</i>

1432
01:24:35,396 --> 01:24:37,765
<i>Otherwise, they are threatening
to kill our mother, Master.</i>

1433
01:24:38,399 --> 01:24:42,770
<i>Sister Charu assured that us
you will come and rescue us.</i>

1434
01:24:43,771 --> 01:24:45,607
<i>Please save us, Master.</i>

1435
01:24:46,107 --> 01:24:47,442
<i>Our poor mother.</i>

1436
01:24:47,642 --> 01:24:49,210
<i>She is all alone.</i>

1437
01:24:49,310 --> 01:24:50,812
<i>My eyes have dried up out of crying.</i>

1438
01:24:51,312 --> 01:24:52,981
<i>I can't cry anymore, Master.</i>

1439
01:24:53,815 --> 01:24:56,184
<i>Please, Brother.
Rescue us from this hell.</i>

1440
01:24:56,851 --> 01:24:58,353
<i>I am begging you, Brother.</i>

1441
01:25:19,274 --> 01:25:20,108
Go ahead.

1442
01:25:21,142 --> 01:25:22,110
I told you, Bhavani.

1443
01:25:22,810 --> 01:25:24,145
I want to win unopposed.

1444
01:25:24,312 --> 01:25:26,548
I called you here
to arrive at a compromise.

1445
01:25:26,648 --> 01:25:28,316
But I can't trust you.

1446
01:25:29,350 --> 01:25:33,187
You'll take any kind of cruel measure
using those juvenile delinquents.

1447
01:25:34,189 --> 01:25:39,060
Should I step out of my house daily
with fear and breathe in fear?

1448
01:25:41,062 --> 01:25:42,030
That is why--

1449
01:25:42,230 --> 01:25:45,099
Did you call me here
planning to kill me?

1450
01:25:47,602 --> 01:25:48,436
You--

1451
01:25:49,103 --> 01:25:50,805
You call someone
with a plan to kill him.

1452
01:25:50,939 --> 01:25:53,474
Treat him royally like a guest
and offer him hot tea.

1453
01:25:53,641 --> 01:25:56,444
You're the only man who
asked for my permission to kill me.

1454
01:25:56,778 --> 01:25:58,680
Instead you could have--

1455
01:25:58,813 --> 01:26:02,317
Putting you on a pedestal, I wanted to
fix an auspicious day to finish you off.

1456
01:26:02,350 --> 01:26:04,185
I need my brain examined!

1457
01:26:06,688 --> 01:26:07,889
Hey! Wait.

1458
01:26:09,057 --> 01:26:10,225
I'll give you two minutes.

1459
01:26:12,227 --> 01:26:14,896
Kill me and then save
your men and yourself.

1460
01:26:37,185 --> 01:26:38,019
Hurry up.

1461
01:26:40,688 --> 01:26:42,690
Do you need an army
to bash up one man?

1462
01:26:43,391 --> 01:26:44,559
Open the door first.

1463
01:27:26,901 --> 01:27:28,436
Hey, he is a teacher.
Watch your blows.

1464
01:27:28,603 --> 01:27:29,771
You've got only ten minutes.

1465
01:27:29,938 --> 01:27:30,939
Come out without too much damage.

1466
01:27:32,640 --> 01:27:34,809
Turn the other way.

1467
01:27:37,312 --> 01:27:38,146
Come, Murali.

1468
01:27:38,646 --> 01:27:39,981
Switch it off and come.

1469
01:28:04,772 --> 01:28:06,975
Pray to God you don't
run into me in your next life.

1470
01:28:07,308 --> 01:28:08,142
Don't, Bhavani.

1471
01:28:19,354 --> 01:28:20,188
Wonder what their plan is!

1472
01:28:21,022 --> 01:28:24,025
Master, my boss has
given you a bus ticket.

1473
01:28:24,225 --> 01:28:26,394
Luxury bus.
Air-conditioned sleeper.

1474
01:28:26,728 --> 01:28:28,730
Leave tonight, you'll reach
your hometown in the morning.

1475
01:28:29,731 --> 01:28:30,832
Got it into your head?

1476
01:28:30,932 --> 01:28:32,767
If you stubbornly refuse,

1477
01:28:32,934 --> 01:28:34,502
you saw the two boys
hanging from the roof, right?

1478
01:28:34,602 --> 01:28:35,937
You'll be next.

1479
01:28:37,105 --> 01:28:38,439
I'm talking to you.

1480
01:28:38,606 --> 01:28:39,974
Is that a love letter in your hand?

