01:44:00,228 --> 01:44:02,764
<i>Won't turn a blind eye
To a crime on the roadside</i>

1709
01:44:02,897 --> 01:44:04,065
My dear angels!

1710
01:44:04,566 --> 01:44:05,567
Can you give us a hand?

1711
01:44:05,600 --> 01:44:07,569
<i>Without discrimination
Of caste, race, religion</i>

1712
01:44:07,602 --> 01:44:08,436
Love, huh?

1713
01:44:08,903 --> 01:44:10,104
<i>Apple of our eye is our nation</i>

1714
01:44:10,271 --> 01:44:14,609
<i>We were patient till now
Reign of terror, World war 3</i>

1715
01:44:14,642 --> 01:44:17,145
<i>Continents will quake and quiver
Nonentities will shake and shiver</i>

1716
01:44:17,312 --> 01:44:18,479
<i>Master spells power</i>

1717
01:44:18,646 --> 01:44:19,480
Take your hands off.

1718
01:44:19,647 --> 01:44:21,316
<i>24 carat gold is he
Lion king royalty</i>

1719
01:44:21,349 --> 01:44:23,184
<i>Move aside, dude
Beast mode</i>

1720
01:44:25,820 --> 01:44:27,689
Master, you had your way?

1721
01:44:27,722 --> 01:44:29,057
You can trim my hair
or tonsure my head.

1722
01:44:29,357 --> 01:44:31,893
Beware of my leader Undiyal.
Try your tricks on him.

1723
01:44:32,060 --> 01:44:33,127
Undiyal, listen to me.

1724
01:44:33,228 --> 01:44:35,363
- Don't go there, go to your block.
- Shut up, Warden.

1725
01:44:35,396 --> 01:44:36,598
- Good morning, Boss.
- Morning.

1726
01:44:36,731 --> 01:44:38,900
Who had the guts to
lay a finger on our hair?

1727
01:44:38,933 --> 01:44:41,169
Is there a rule about
the length of the hair?

1728
01:44:41,269 --> 01:44:43,504
Master, do you know the rules or not?

1729
01:44:43,605 --> 01:44:45,773
You are having a free hand
with everyone's heads.

1730
01:44:47,442 --> 01:44:48,276
Master.

1731
01:44:48,943 --> 01:44:49,811
Let go of me, Master.

1732
01:44:53,481 --> 01:44:55,183
You don't know who
you're laying your hands on.

1733
01:44:55,316 --> 01:44:56,851
You will regret what you're doing.

1734
01:44:56,985 --> 01:44:58,853
<i>Master's raid
Pain post-paid</i>

1735
01:44:58,987 --> 01:45:00,688
<i>Don't get into strife
Run for your life</i>

1736
01:45:00,722 --> 01:45:01,856
Don't do it.

1737
01:45:03,024 --> 01:45:04,359
I'm scared.

1738
01:45:04,893 --> 01:45:06,127
- Hey, Dheena.
- Sir.

1739
01:45:06,227 --> 01:45:07,729
- Let it be a close cut.
- Yes, sir.

1740
01:45:08,530 --> 01:45:10,932
<i>Don't run over him
And look the other way</i>

1741
01:45:11,065 --> 01:45:13,334
<i>Don't get into his bad books
Stay away</i>

1742
01:45:13,434 --> 01:45:14,903
<i>Master's raid
All crimes waylaid</i>

1743
01:45:14,936 --> 01:45:16,070
<i>Master's raid</i>

1744
01:45:16,104 --> 01:45:18,473
<i>A-Aa-E-Ee, A-B-C-D
This is our time, buddy</i>

1745
01:45:18,606 --> 01:45:21,109
<i>Brother, good morning
Master's raid in full swing</i>

1746
01:45:23,444 --> 01:45:25,313
Next week will be
back to square one.

1747
01:45:25,346 --> 01:45:27,515
You can come back
and scrub it again, okay?

1748
01:45:27,682 --> 01:45:28,816
Bye, Sweetheart.

1749
01:45:29,183 --> 01:45:31,519
I've never seen such bad
nicotine stains at such an young age, JD.

1750
01:45:31,686 --> 01:45:33,721
Prise open their mouth
it's like a cigarette shop!

1751
01:45:33,855 --> 01:45:36,724
I have collected cavity samples
from the six boys you mentioned.

1752
01:45:37,392 --> 01:45:39,727
- How long will it take?
- I'll let you know in one or two days.

1753
01:45:39,861 --> 01:45:40,695
Thanks, Madhi.

1754
01:45:42,564 --> 01:45:44,399
He left me with a half shaved
moustache and beard.

1755
01:45:45,099 --> 01:45:46,234
Such a disgrace!

1756
01:45:46,267 --> 01:45:48,069
I feel like I am naked!

1757
01:45:48,102 --> 01:45:50,772
I'm so mad I want to kill him right now.

1758
01:45:51,439 --> 01:45:53,474
In this dirty business,
enemies will come and go.

1759
01:45:53,975 --> 01:45:56,644
If we rage like a mad bull against every
single enemy, our life will be ruined.

1760
01:45:57,612 --> 01:45:58,813
Handle him with patience.

1761
01:45:58,980 --> 01:46:00,515
<i>Make him run in all four directions.</i>

1762
01:46:00,815 --> 01:46:02,016
Don't let him sleep.

1763
01:46:02,517 --> 01:46:04,185
- Torture him mentally.
- Fine.

1764
01:46:04,319 --> 01:46:05,520
- Hey--
- I'll tackle him.

1765
01:46:39,520 --> 01:46:41,055
Hey! Come out.

1766
01:46:41,189 --> 01:46:43,558
Listen to me.
I'm telling you boys.

1767
01:46:43,691 --> 01:46:45,059
Listen to me.

1768
01:46:45,226 --> 01:46:46,127
Wait.

1769
01:46:46,227 --> 01:46:48,296
- What happened?
- Sir, I don't know.

1770
01:46:48,396 --> 01:46:49,764
They just started a brawl
and started hitting each other.

1771
01:46:49,898 --> 01:46:52,000
Back door is open in A block.
What to do now?

1772
01:46:52,100 --> 01:46:53,234
Go look for the key.

1773
01:46:53,935 --> 01:46:54,769
Hurry up.

1774
01:46:54,903 --> 01:46:55,737
Quick, man.

1775
01:46:55,904 --> 01:46:57,605
Don't let anyone out.
Lock them up in the class.

1776
01:46:57,772 --> 01:46:59,641
- Okay, sir.
- Give me the torch.

1777
01:46:59,807 --> 01:47:00,942
You'll get bashed up.

1778
01:47:12,654 --> 01:47:13,488
Get lost!

1779
01:47:41,516 --> 01:47:42,350
Hello, sir.

1780
01:47:42,517 --> 01:47:44,919
<i>- Yes, tell me.</i>
- None of our boys are missing I hope.

1781
01:47:45,019 --> 01:47:47,388
No, sir, the head count is 63.

1782
01:47:47,522 --> 01:47:49,390
<i>Not one of them is missing.</i>

1783
01:47:50,391 --> 01:47:52,193
<i>They came from outside for sure.</i>

1784
01:48:21,856 --> 01:48:23,191
It's burning!

1785
01:48:25,393 --> 01:48:26,728
Oh, God!

1786
01:48:29,731 --> 01:48:31,266
You're hurting me.

1787
01:48:34,903 --> 01:48:36,938
Bala!

1788
01:48:37,605 --> 01:48:38,940
What happened to you?

1789
01:48:40,141 --> 01:48:41,609
You messed up my face, right?

1790
01:48:41,976 --> 01:48:42,810
Go, collect your mess.

1791
01:48:43,311 --> 01:48:45,980
- This is just the beginning, master?
- Look at this, Master.

1792
01:48:46,814 --> 01:48:49,150
Hit them at least once, Master.

1793
01:49:24,018 --> 01:49:27,355
Hey master! This is your fate
every single minute you are here.

1794
01:49:27,689 --> 01:49:30,391
Don't think this is the end.
There's more to come.

1795
01:49:30,558 --> 01:49:32,393
We will escape from here tonight.

1796
01:49:32,894 --> 01:49:34,229
Stop us if you can.

1797
01:49:47,775 --> 01:49:49,110
I was on my bike
sticking to the kerb side.

1798
01:49:49,143 --> 01:49:52,313
Whether he collided by mistake
or deliberately targeted me,

1799
01:49:52,347 --> 01:49:53,982
<i>only God knows.</i>

1800
01:49:54,182 --> 01:49:55,516
<i>But his intention is to provoke you.</i>

1801
01:49:55,683 --> 01:49:58,853
He wants you to lose your cool
and raise your hand on those boys.

1802
01:49:59,020 --> 01:50:01,689
<i>So that the authorities can move
you someplace else.</i>

1803
01:50:01,856 --> 01:50:03,558
<i>Don't act rashly on impulse.</i>

1804
01:50:05,560 --> 01:50:07,395
Only his leg is fractured.
Hand is intact, right?

1805
01:50:30,318 --> 01:50:31,152
Sorry.

1806
01:50:31,686 --> 01:50:33,354
I couldn't do anything to help you.

1807
01:50:33,688 --> 01:50:34,856
It's okay, forget it.

1808
01:50:35,023 --> 01:50:36,224
What can you do?

1809
01:50:36,891 --> 01:50:39,527
My fear is those grown up boys are
waiting to pounce on us in kabaddi.

1810
01:50:39,561 --> 01:50:42,564
How can we play against
these grown-ups?

1811
01:50:42,730 --> 01:50:44,265
In case we lose,

1812
01:50:44,599 --> 01:50:46,100
we'll be 'alti'
this entire month.

1813
01:50:46,267 --> 01:50:47,235
What does 'alti' mean?

1814
01:50:47,769 --> 01:50:49,437
Being an errand boy.

1815
01:50:49,571 --> 01:50:52,273
To be at their beck and call,
do all their dirty jobs like a slave.

1816
01:50:52,440 --> 01:50:53,975
I'll anyway lose.

1817
01:50:54,309 --> 01:50:56,978
I am agreeable to being an 'alti'
but they insist I should play, master.

1818
01:50:57,312 --> 01:50:58,813
I snitched to you, right?

1819
01:50:59,180 --> 01:51:00,915
Using kabaddi as an excuse

1820
01:51:01,015 --> 01:51:02,817
they plan to bash me up, master.

1821
01:51:03,518 --> 01:51:04,352
Hey, Undiyal!

1822
01:51:05,353 --> 01:51:06,187
Come.

1823
01:51:08,556 --> 01:51:09,390
Look here.

1824
01:51:09,891 --> 01:51:10,625
Look at me.

1825
01:51:10,725 --> 01:51:11,559
I am talking to you!

1826
01:51:12,193 --> 01:51:14,195
You're coming
or shall I carry you here?

1827
01:51:14,362 --> 01:51:15,930
More than the aches
from blows and kicks,

1828
01:51:16,898 --> 01:51:18,600
pain of fear hurts deeper!

1829
01:51:19,601 --> 01:51:20,435
Go with courage.

1830
01:51:21,736 --> 01:51:23,104
Go and check what he's doing.

1831
01:51:23,404 --> 01:51:25,106
Das, he is coming.

1832
01:51:50,431 --> 01:51:51,266
Tell me, Madhi.

1833
01:51:51,399 --> 01:51:53,268
You snitched about us
to the master, right?

1834
01:51:53,601 --> 01:51:55,103
- Face us now.
- Hey!

1835
01:51:55,236 --> 01:51:56,571
I know very well.

1836
01:51:56,604 --> 01:51:58,940
If Bala plays, we will win for sure.

1837
01:51:59,107 --> 01:52:01,309
So you got scared
and broke his hand.

1838
01:52:01,476 --> 01:52:03,444
Had he been here
would he have defeated us?

1839
01:52:03,611 --> 01:52:05,647
Of course. You would
have lost pathetically.

1840
01:52:06,314 --> 01:52:08,816
Call whomever, how many ever boys
you want from here to play on your side.

1841
01:52:08,850 --> 01:52:11,319
I'll call anyone I want, but then
you can't go back on your word.

1842
01:52:11,352 --> 01:52:14,022
Go ahead. We won't send you back
without breaking all your teeth today!

1843
01:52:17,392 --> 01:52:19,561
Master!

1844
01:52:21,062 --> 01:52:22,730
<i>Clash of wills here</i>

1845
01:52:24,766 --> 01:52:26,267
<i>One foot in the grave, no fear</i>

1846
01:52:28,436 --> 01:52:29,938
<i>You are ready for your bier</i>

1847
01:52:31,606 --> 01:52:34,642
<i>Kabaddi... kabaddi... do hold your breath</i>

1848
01:52:34,809 --> 01:52:38,646
<i>Kabaddi... kabaddi... to show your strength</i>

1849
01:52:46,354 --> 01:52:48,089
- Tell me, Madhi.<i>-I checked the results.</i>

1850
01:52:48,189 --> 01:52:50,725
I am sure all six of them
are above 20 years of age.

1851
01:52:54,229 --> 01:52:56,264
<i>Kabaddi... kabaddi... play.</i>

1852
01:52:56,397 --> 01:52:59,601
<i>On your mark, get set full gear
Sandalwood paste smeared</i>

1853
01:52:59,734 --> 01:53:03,004
<i>One foot in the grave, no fear
You are ready for your bier</i>

1854
01:53:03,104 --> 01:53:03,938
What are you saying?

1855
01:53:04,939 --> 01:53:06,474
Not one of them is below 18?

1856
01:53:06,608 --> 01:53:09,143
It's confirmed that none of those boys
are younger than 18.

1857
01:53:15,850 --> 01:53:17,518
<i>On your mark, get set, ready</i>

1858
01:53:22,857 --> 01:53:24,392
<i>Bash them up deadly</i>

1859
01:53:26,227 --> 01:53:28,897
Master, at least do you know
the name of this game?

1860
01:53:29,230 --> 01:53:30,899
This is not cricket or football.

1861
01:53:31,266 --> 01:53:33,268
You must hold your breath
and repeat 'kabaddi', you know?

1862
01:53:35,436 --> 01:53:36,604
Our rules are different.

1863
01:53:36,738 --> 01:53:38,139
You can't just touch and run.

1864
01:53:38,806 --> 01:53:40,608
You must toss your opponent
outside the line.

1865
01:53:40,642 --> 01:53:42,143
Still want to play?

1866
01:53:45,146 --> 01:53:45,980
Come on.

1867
01:53:59,394 --> 01:54:01,229
<i>Kabaddi... kabaddi... kabaddi play</i>

1868
01:54:06,267 --> 01:54:07,769
Kabaddi.

1869
01:54:10,104 --> 01:54:12,373
Kabaddi... kabaddi... kabaddi!

1870
01:54:12,473 --> 01:54:13,975
Go.

1871
01:54:15,310 --> 01:54:17,312
<i>On your mark, get set, full gear</i>

1872
01:54:18,813 --> 01:54:20,215
<i>Sandalwood paste smeared here</i>

1873
01:54:20,315 --> 01:54:21,849
Trying your tricks with us?

1874
01:54:22,350 --> 01:54:24,185
<i>You are ready for your bier</i>

1875
01:54:25,687 --> 01:54:27,522
<i>Your downfall is marked</i>

1876
01:54:29,390 --> 01:54:30,892
Bingo!

1877
01:54:31,059 --> 01:54:32,060
He got a solid slap.

1878
01:54:35,063 --> 01:54:36,064
Knock him down.

1879
01:54:49,978 --> 01:54:52,513
Kabaddi!

1880
01:54:57,852 --> 01:54:58,686
He deserves it!

1881
01:55:02,690 --> 01:55:05,059
- Superb, Master
- Come on.

1882
01:55:05,226 --> 01:55:06,394
He is hitting us real hard.

1883
01:55:06,528 --> 01:55:08,396
If you have the guts,
show it now.

1884
01:55:08,730 --> 01:55:10,732
Come. Come on.

1885
01:55:10,765 --> 01:55:13,234
Kabaddi... kabaddi... kabaddi.

1886
01:55:14,068 --> 01:55:16,738
- Come on.
- Kabaddi... kabaddi... kabaddi.

1887
01:55:17,272 --> 01:55:18,606
Lift him.

1888
01:55:19,974 --> 01:55:22,310
You dare lay a finger on us.
Now, wait and watch!

1889
01:55:23,645 --> 01:55:25,146
Come. Come on.

1890
01:55:29,183 --> 01:55:31,319
How dare you break a boy's hand!

1891
01:55:32,186 --> 01:55:34,189
- It hurts.
- This is tit for tat time.

1892
01:55:34,689 --> 01:55:36,391
Master, it really hurts.

1893
01:55:54,475 --> 01:55:56,644
<i>Kabbadi... kabbadi... kabbadi</i>

1894
01:56:01,516 --> 01:56:02,850
<i>All set to knock you down</i>

1895
01:56:02,984 --> 01:56:06,254
<i>Lick your defeat with face on the ground</i>

1896
01:56:06,354 --> 01:56:09,858
<i>On your mark, get set, ready to lose</i>

1897
01:56:09,891 --> 01:56:13,361
<i>One step to defeat, time for the noose</i>

1898
01:56:54,903 --> 01:56:57,105
<i>Get set, sandalwood paste smeared</i>

1899
01:56:57,138 --> 01:56:58,673
Hey, come on!

1900
01:56:58,773 --> 01:57:01,476
<i>Clash of wills here
Be ready to lie on your bier</i>

1901
01:57:02,644 --> 01:57:05,146
<i>Kabaddi... kabaddi... touch the line</i>

1902
01:57:06,848 --> 01:57:08,349
Watch the line.

1903
01:57:10,852 --> 01:57:13,688
If you dare lay a finger
on these boys one more time...

1904
01:57:15,723 --> 01:57:18,293
<i>Kabaddi... kabaddi... hold your breath</i>

1905
01:57:18,393 --> 01:57:22,897
<i>Kabaddi... touch to show your strength</i>

1906
01:57:23,932 --> 01:57:24,766
Master?

1907
01:57:25,934 --> 01:57:26,768
Master?

1908
01:57:27,769 --> 01:57:29,404
- What?
- Is it okay to talk frankly?

1909
01:57:29,437 --> 01:57:31,773
- Camera is recording everything.
- Go on, it's okay.

1910
01:57:31,940 --> 01:57:32,974
I'll tell you, Master.

1911
01:57:33,474 --> 01:57:35,143
My mother passed away
when I was born.

1912
01:57:36,144 --> 01:57:37,812
My neighbor raised me.

1913
01:57:38,479 --> 01:57:41,015
My father asked her
to sleep with him!

1914
01:57:41,516 --> 01:57:42,350
That's why

1915
01:57:43,184 --> 01:57:44,852
I threw the grinding stone on his head.

1916
01:57:45,186 --> 01:57:47,689
Immediately, the police put me in jail.

1917
01:57:48,389 --> 01:57:50,391
That's when Das trapped me.

1918
01:57:50,892 --> 01:57:53,895
From then on I was forced to listen
what Das says.

1919
01:57:56,231 --> 01:57:57,232
Das will walk in.

1920
01:57:57,265 --> 01:57:59,434
He will check who is addicted to drugs.

1921
01:58:00,268 --> 01:58:02,770
Powder, smoke, booze.
Then he will increase the dosage.

1922
01:58:04,639 --> 01:58:06,107
Which one of you here

1923
01:58:07,475 --> 01:58:08,810
has seen Bhavani?

1924
01:58:09,143 --> 01:58:10,278
Bhavani?

1925
01:58:10,645 --> 01:58:12,480
Where have I heard this name?

1926
01:58:12,814 --> 01:58:13,815
Somehow sounds familiar.

1927
01:58:14,315 --> 01:58:15,183
Master.

1928
01:58:15,984 --> 01:58:18,519
We have heard this name,
but none of us have seen him.

1929
01:58:18,853 --> 01:58:20,722
Das is the be all and end all here.

1930
01:58:21,189 --> 01:58:22,790
We must obey him.

1931
01:58:22,891 --> 01:58:25,560
If he asks us to surrender,
we should do so with our eyes closed.

1932
01:58:25,727 --> 01:58:26,728
Otherwise, we will be hanged.

1933
01:58:26,895 --> 01:58:28,396
They recently hanged two boys.

1934
01:58:28,563 --> 01:58:29,731
Didn't you see that, Master?

1935
01:58:31,933 --> 01:58:33,434
Do you all want to go home
and live with your family?

1936
01:58:34,235 --> 01:58:35,403
Or do you want to surrender?

1937
01:58:35,904 --> 01:58:38,473
- Go home, Master.
- Be with our family.

1938
01:58:39,274 --> 01:58:40,942
You have been here for ten days

1939
01:58:40,975 --> 01:58:43,111
and we haven't taken drugs
during this time.

1940
01:58:43,311 --> 01:58:44,979
Now we are ourselves.

1941
01:58:46,481 --> 01:58:48,016
Help us escape from here, Master.

1942
01:58:48,850 --> 01:58:52,253
If you follow what I say, you can
go home and live as you wish.

1943
01:58:52,353 --> 01:58:53,321
Will you do as I say?

1944
01:58:53,354 --> 01:58:55,523
- Yes, Master.
- We will.

1945
01:58:55,890 --> 01:59:00,295
Whatever you shared with me now,
will you tell the same to the magistrate?

1946
01:59:00,395 --> 01:59:02,297
Of course, we will, Master.

1947
01:59:02,397 --> 01:59:05,233
I'll arrange all the formalities
to get them out on parole.

1948
01:59:05,400 --> 01:59:06,234
Thanks, sir.

1949
01:59:06,267 --> 01:59:08,436
Let the video evidence
be with Charu till then.

1950
01:59:08,770 --> 01:59:10,438
It will reach the magistrate
when you say so.

1951
01:59:10,471 --> 01:59:13,808
Master, you shot some video
and cleverly made us confess.

1952
01:59:14,142 --> 01:59:15,877
You haven't shared your story.

1953
01:59:15,977 --> 01:59:17,312
Tell us. We want to know.

1954
01:59:17,645 --> 01:59:19,480
Come on, ask him guys.
Cat got your tongues or what?

1955
01:59:19,647 --> 01:59:21,416
- Tell us.
- Tell us, Master.

1956
01:59:21,516 --> 01:59:23,184
Please share your story, Master.

1957
01:59:23,318 --> 01:59:25,019
We are requesting you.
Please tell us.

1958
01:59:25,153 --> 01:59:27,789
Don't ask for trouble.
Trust my voice of experience!

1959
01:59:27,856 --> 01:59:29,724
Wait, they are very eager to hear.

1960
01:59:29,858 --> 01:59:31,059
I'll be happy to share.
Let them enjoy.

1961
01:59:31,559 --> 01:59:33,027
I was in college then.

1962
01:59:33,394 --> 01:59:34,863
I think it was my final year.

1963
01:59:35,363 --> 01:59:37,765
A new teacher joined our college.

1964
01:59:38,600 --> 01:59:39,567
Her name was Malar.

1965
01:59:40,768 --> 01:59:42,770
That love was just unbelievable.

1966
01:59:48,309 --> 01:59:50,278
All of a sudden the girl I loved

1967
01:59:50,645 --> 01:59:52,046
met with an accident.

1968
01:59:52,146 --> 01:59:53,314
She forgot her past.

1969
01:59:53,648 --> 01:59:55,316
She didn't even know who I was.

1970
01:59:56,517 --> 01:59:57,852
She even forgot my mad love for her.

1971
01:59:58,987 --> 02:00:03,057
Fate made me attend her wedding and
present her a bouquet with my own hands!

1972
02:00:04,726 --> 02:00:05,560
After tha--

1973
02:00:07,061 --> 02:00:09,564
Why are all of you
sniffling and crying?

1974
02:00:09,898 --> 02:00:11,933
Now that girl has totally
forgotten her past.

1975
02:00:12,233 --> 02:00:14,502
Master, isn't that teacher Sister Charu?

1976
02:00:14,602 --> 02:00:17,205
Hey, she's a teacher
and a colleague of mine.

1977
02:00:17,272 --> 02:00:18,773
That was my college time.

1978
02:00:19,274 --> 02:00:21,376
Down the memory lane.
Teacher Malar.

1979
02:00:21,476 --> 02:00:23,444
Don't you watch Malayalam movies?

1980
02:00:23,478 --> 02:00:25,313
If I don't understand the language,

1981
02:00:25,680 --> 02:00:26,648
- I won't watch.
- Okay.

1982
02:00:26,814 --> 02:00:28,349
Getting late.
All of you leave.

1983
02:00:28,516 --> 02:00:30,585
Class tomorrow morning as usual.

1984
02:00:30,685 --> 02:00:31,853
Okay, Master.
Bye, Master.

1985
02:00:32,353 --> 02:00:34,355
How much longer
will you quote a film story

1986
02:00:34,389 --> 02:00:36,291
if someone asks you
about your past life

1987
02:00:36,391 --> 02:00:38,860
and fool yourself and trick others too?

1988
02:00:39,194 --> 02:00:40,228
What film story?

1989
02:00:41,229 --> 02:00:42,063
Don't act.

1990
02:00:42,397 --> 02:00:43,731
What you narrated was the story
of the Malayalam film 'Premam'.

1991
02:00:44,399 --> 02:00:46,734
They stole my story
and made a movie out of it!

1992
02:00:47,268 --> 02:00:49,604
One track mind
on plagiarism, huh?

1993
02:00:50,939 --> 02:00:53,141
Okay, what do you want to know?

1994
02:00:53,308 --> 02:00:54,142
Tell me.

1995
02:00:54,442 --> 02:00:55,977
Why did you start drinking?

1996
02:00:57,946 --> 02:00:59,681
Every drunkard will have a story.

1997
02:00:59,814 --> 02:01:01,015
Why go into it now?

1998
02:01:01,349 --> 02:01:02,317
If I tell you my reason,

1999
02:01:02,350 --> 02:01:05,853
a handful of them
will follow my footsteps.

2000
02:01:07,388 --> 02:01:09,057
Is that necessary?
Isn't it wrong?

2001
02:01:09,557 --> 02:01:10,558
Okay, okay.

2002
02:01:11,226 --> 02:01:13,561
I won't tell you now
why I got into this habit.

2003
02:01:14,062 --> 02:01:16,397
If you like, I'll tell you
why I quit, shall I?

2004
02:01:28,810 --> 02:01:33,815
<i>When we see those eyes of his
Won't love naturally bloom in us?</i>

2005
02:01:33,982 --> 02:01:39,187
<i>When we go close to him especially
Won't our mind skip like a deer joyfully?</i>

2006
02:01:40,889 --> 02:01:44,292
<i>Residing in her heart all the time
His style, his stride so sublime</i>

2007
02:01:44,392 --> 02:01:49,898
<i>Featuring in her dreams always
His charming dear face</i>

2008
02:01:51,599 --> 02:01:54,269
<i>He is Mr Handsome truly
He is our Master, one and only</i>

2009
02:01:54,402 --> 02:01:57,605
<i>His smile, not too much, not too less</i>

2010
02:01:57,639 --> 02:02:01,943
<i>His charisma beams through in excess</i>

2011
02:02:02,944 --> 02:02:05,313
<i>His heart is soft as a flower
Youthfulness is his signature</i>

2012
02:02:05,480 --> 02:02:07,849
<i>I pity our girls for sure</i>

2013
02:02:08,182 --> 02:02:10,585
<i>His smile is like a sparkler
He's good natured forever</i>

2014
02:02:10,685 --> 02:02:13,187
<i>This master with his class
Covers one and all en masse</i>

2015
02:02:13,354 --> 02:02:18,560
<i>If his fire work-glance falls on you
A failed heart will pass too</i>

2016
02:02:18,726 --> 02:02:21,896
<i>He is single, our news a fact
This is your chance to act</i>

2017
02:02:22,063 --> 02:02:27,101
<i>When we see those eyes of his
Won't love naturally bloom in us?</i>

2018
02:02:27,435 --> 02:02:31,839
<i>When we go close to him especially
Won't our mind skip like a deer joyfully?</i>

2019
02:02:31,940 --> 02:02:33,975
JD is an orphan.

2020
02:02:34,309 --> 02:02:36,144
He grew up like a wild tree.

2021
02:02:36,311 --> 02:02:37,812
Only after joining this college,

2022
02:02:37,946 --> 02:02:39,147
he met a professor.

2023
02:02:39,314 --> 02:02:42,083
His friendship and care
changed JD's life altogether.

2024
02:02:42,183 --> 02:02:43,151
V. C. Selvam.

2025
02:02:43,851 --> 02:02:45,820
Unfortunately, he had a health issue.

2026
02:02:45,853 --> 02:02:47,689
He got admitted
in a hospital to get treated--

2027
02:02:48,022 --> 02:02:49,724
That really shattered JD.

2028
02:02:50,058 --> 02:02:51,893
After that he was unable to sleep.

2029
02:02:52,393 --> 02:02:54,896
That bloody alcohol took over him.

2030
02:02:55,730 --> 02:02:59,000
<i>Residing in her heart all the time
His style, his stride so divine</i>

2031
02:02:59,100 --> 02:03:04,606
<i>Featuring in her dreams always
His endearing dear face</i>

2032
02:03:06,140 --> 02:03:09,143
<i>He is Mr Handsome truly
He is our Master, one and only</i>

2033
02:03:09,277 --> 02:03:12,146
<i>His smile, not too much, not too less</i>

2034
02:03:12,480 --> 02:03:15,850
<i>His charisma beams through in excess</i>

2035
02:03:17,352 --> 02:03:19,854
<i>Friendly gaze he sweeps
Calm and collected he speaks</i>

2036
02:03:19,988 --> 02:03:22,390
<i>No holds barred at all
All of them flip and fall</i>

2037
02:03:22,891 --> 02:03:25,393
<i>Magnetic personality
Quick and slick, sharp is he</i>

2038
02:03:25,527 --> 02:03:27,729
<i>Our master is always
Top in all ways</i>

2039
02:03:27,896 --> 02:03:33,234
<i>Some kind of innate power he displays
Endearing temerity always in place</i>

2040
02:03:33,268 --> 02:03:36,504
<i>If he stands solo, which miss
Won't yearn to be his Mrs?</i>

2041
02:03:36,604 --> 02:03:40,308
<i>When we see those eyes of his
won't love naturally bloom in us?</i>

2042
02:03:40,775 --> 02:03:41,609
What--

2043
02:03:42,443 --> 02:03:43,278
Please move.

2044
02:03:51,185 --> 02:03:52,020
Hey!

2045
02:04:00,528 --> 02:04:01,362
Come on.

2046
02:04:11,606 --> 02:04:12,440
Tell me, Charu.

2047
02:04:12,607 --> 02:04:13,808
Sir, don't know who they are.

2048
02:04:13,975 --> 02:04:15,810
About three boys are chasing me.

2049
02:04:16,144 --> 02:04:18,313
Charu, where are you?
Which area?

2050
02:04:18,446 --> 02:04:19,647
In Triplicane, Murugan temple...

2051
02:04:20,815 --> 02:04:22,016
The road opposite Murugan temple.

2052
02:04:28,356 --> 02:04:29,390
- There she is.
- Charu?

2053
02:04:30,892 --> 02:04:31,726
Charu!

2054
02:04:35,430 --> 02:04:36,264
Follow me.

2055
02:04:50,144 --> 02:04:53,348
<i>They started chasing me when I was
on my way to the magistrate's house.</i>

2056
02:04:53,648 --> 02:04:56,150
I don't know what to do
or where to go.

2057
02:04:56,517 --> 02:04:58,686
Charu, don't be scared.
I will send our boys.

2058
02:04:59,354 --> 02:05:01,756
Go inside some shop there.

2059
02:05:01,856 --> 02:05:03,191
<i>Enter a shop to be safe.</i>

2060
02:05:04,726 --> 02:05:06,561
<i>Thank you for calling, Parandhaman.</i>

2061
02:05:08,196 --> 02:05:10,265
- I've come into a shop, sir.
- Turn on the speaker.

2062
02:05:10,431 --> 02:05:11,599
What do you need?

2063
02:05:12,433 --> 02:05:14,102
<i>Brother, one minute please.
Listen to what I have to say.</i>

2064
02:05:16,104 --> 02:05:17,605
<i>Let this girl hide
in your shop for a while.</i>

2065
02:05:17,639 --> 02:05:19,040
<i>I'll send my men, please.</i>

2066
02:05:19,140 --> 02:05:22,043
My business will get affected.
Don't involve me, clear out.

2067
02:05:22,143 --> 02:05:23,878
Aren't you a fiery blooded youth?

2068
02:05:23,978 --> 02:05:25,313
<i>Speak boldly.</i>

2069
02:05:25,647 --> 02:05:27,582
Brother, I'll take care.

2070
02:05:27,649 --> 02:05:29,017
- <i>You don't worry.</i>
- Thank you, Brother.

2071
02:05:29,684 --> 02:05:30,818
Come here, Dear.

2072
02:05:47,268 --> 02:05:49,604
- Did a girl come in here?
- No.

2073
02:05:49,771 --> 02:05:53,641
<i>My dark and bold beauty
Why was he Uncle Scrooge?</i>

2074
02:05:54,642 --> 02:05:58,613
<i>He made my heart soft and cottony
Quake with desire, explode in rhapsody</i>

2075
02:05:59,647 --> 02:06:04,319
<i>Tell me the auspicious time
When wedding bells will chime?</i>

2076
02:06:07,689 --> 02:06:09,724
- Master, they are teasing m--
- Sshh!

2077
02:06:10,191 --> 02:06:13,561
<i>He made my heart soft and cottony
Quake with desire, explode in rhapsody</i>

2078
02:06:16,731 --> 02:06:18,266
I told you no one came in here.

2079
02:06:19,934 --> 02:06:21,603
Brother, where are you going in?

2080
02:06:21,736 --> 02:06:22,604
Listen.

2081
02:06:22,770 --> 02:06:24,205
He already told you no one is here.

2082
02:06:24,272 --> 02:06:25,807
Oldie, shut up.

2083
02:06:34,849 --> 02:06:36,184
If you give it to me,

2084
02:06:36,351 --> 02:06:38,019
I'll give you a quick death.

2085
02:06:38,853 --> 02:06:40,188
Otherwise, I will--

2086
02:06:40,522 --> 02:06:42,023
- Hey, hey.
- Wait, Master.

2087
02:06:42,190 --> 02:06:43,691
This face looks familiar.

2088
02:06:44,225 --> 02:06:45,226
<i>Sister.</i>

2089
02:06:46,561 --> 02:06:47,729
<i>Show him the screen.</i>

2090
02:06:51,766 --> 02:06:52,567
Hey Undiyal!

2091
02:06:52,600 --> 02:06:54,435
<i>Hey Button, my dear friend!</i>

2092
02:06:55,270 --> 02:06:56,437
Undiyal, guys.

2093
02:06:56,938 --> 02:06:58,139
What are you doing
in this video call?

2094
02:06:58,273 --> 02:07:00,542
Hey, the girl you are chasing
is my sister.

2095
02:07:00,642 --> 02:07:01,976
<i>- Your sister?
- Yes.</i>

2096
02:07:03,144 --> 02:07:04,312
I didn't know that.

2097
02:07:04,646 --> 02:07:07,248
I was told to finish her off.
That's way I chased her down.

2098
02:07:07,348 --> 02:07:09,017
Well, what do you want from her?

2099
02:07:10,685 --> 02:07:12,687
- What is that?
- She has a camera.

2100
02:07:13,688 --> 02:07:15,023
I believe she has a camera.

2101
02:07:15,190 --> 02:07:17,058
Ask her to give it to us.
We'll leave.

2102
02:07:17,725 --> 02:07:19,727
Sister, give him what he wants.

2103
02:07:19,861 --> 02:07:21,229
We will think about it later.

2104
02:07:21,396 --> 02:07:22,564
<i>Okay?</i>

2105
02:07:22,931 --> 02:07:24,332
<i>Just give it to him, Sister.</i>

2106
02:07:24,432 --> 02:07:27,936
<i>My eyes can't close at night
Without leaning on your chest in delight</i>

2107
02:07:33,141 --> 02:07:34,142
<i>Hey, Button.</i>

2108
02:07:35,143 --> 02:07:36,878
I told you she's my sister.
I didn't hear your apology?

2109
02:07:36,978 --> 02:07:38,613
- Apologize to her.
- Sorry, Sister.

2110
02:07:38,646 --> 02:07:40,248
<i>Hey! You boys too.</i>

2111
02:07:40,315 --> 02:07:41,182
Sorry, Sister.

2112
02:07:42,517 --> 02:07:43,351
That's good.

2113
02:07:43,685 --> 02:07:46,087
Master, it's over.
Sister is safe.

2114
02:07:46,187 --> 02:07:47,889
You talk to her.
I'll wait there.

2115
02:07:49,023 --> 02:07:50,525
Charu, leave that place immediately.

2116
02:07:51,559 --> 02:07:54,562
<i>Trust us even if we are teeny
For you, we get our hands dirty</i>

2117
02:07:54,729 --> 02:07:58,566
<i>We can steal a weapon in jail
Chase you, hot on your trail</i>

2118
02:07:58,600 --> 02:08:02,770
<i>Chew gum for flavor
Take the boys you favor</i>

2119
02:08:03,238 --> 02:08:05,139
Who are you guys?

2120
02:08:05,773 --> 02:08:07,275
And what are you doing?

2121
02:08:07,475 --> 02:08:08,309
Look.

2122
02:08:09,978 --> 02:08:10,812
What is this tattoo?

2123
02:08:11,479 --> 02:08:12,313
I'll tell you.

2124
02:08:12,347 --> 02:08:13,915
When boys are sent to this home,

2125
02:08:13,982 --> 02:08:16,851
Mr. Das will pick up
the sharp ones and train them.

2126
02:08:17,018 --> 02:08:20,522
When we get released, he will tattoo
our hand with this Tamil letter 'pa'.

2127
02:08:20,688 --> 02:08:23,691
If we show this tattoo in the mess,
we can eat to our stomach's content.

2128
02:08:23,725 --> 02:08:26,194
If you are older, you'll get
plenty of booze and cigarettes too.

2129
02:08:26,394 --> 02:08:28,229
You can get clothes for free
from textile shops.

2130
02:08:28,363 --> 02:08:31,099
They will even get you
dope from pharmacies.

2131
02:08:32,433 --> 02:08:33,434
But the hitch is.

2132
02:08:34,102 --> 02:08:37,505
Every now and then, they will
make us surrender for a crime.

2133
02:08:37,605 --> 02:08:39,641
Not to get back into the old
bad ways, I'm staying aloof.

2134
02:08:44,979 --> 02:08:47,682
<i>We have heard this name,
but none of us have seen him.</i>

2135
02:08:48,149 --> 02:08:49,984
Das is the be all and end all here.

2136
02:08:50,184 --> 02:08:51,586
<i>- We must obey him implicitly.
- Hey!</i>

2137
02:08:51,686 --> 02:08:53,855
- Is it a newly released film or what?
- <i>No one can defy him.</i>

2138
02:08:54,022 --> 02:08:56,224
<i>If he asks us to surrender,
we should with our eyes closed.</i>

2139
02:08:56,357 --> 02:08:57,392
How did you lose track of him?

2140
02:08:58,226 --> 02:09:00,461
Don't know how, Bhavani
I sent only the professionals.

2141
02:09:00,562 --> 02:09:02,030
- Somehow, they messed it up--
- Shut up!

2142
02:09:05,767 --> 02:09:07,101
What do we do with this, sir?

2143
02:09:07,602 --> 02:09:11,206
It has a card inside which stores
whatever we shoot or click.

2144
02:09:11,272 --> 02:09:14,309
Break that card alone and
keep the camera at my place.

2145
02:09:15,109 --> 02:09:15,944
Okay.

2146
02:09:16,311 --> 02:09:17,779
When are they announcing the results?

2147
02:09:17,812 --> 02:09:19,480
Heard it's on Monday or Tuesday.

2148
02:09:20,148 --> 02:09:21,349
You'll anyway win unopposed.

2149
02:09:21,482 --> 02:09:22,650
Why should you be tense?

2150
02:09:23,851 --> 02:09:25,687
- I can enjoy, right?
- Yes, then what?

2151
02:09:28,723 --> 02:09:29,557
Sit here.

2152
02:09:32,861 --> 02:09:34,062
Do you know this ostrich?

2153
02:09:35,230 --> 02:09:36,931
A bird with a long neck like this.

2154
02:09:37,232 --> 02:09:39,234
Have you seen its egg?
It will be this big.

2155
02:09:39,267 --> 02:09:41,436
So big in size.

2156
02:09:42,270 --> 02:09:44,939
But only that ostrich will know
the pain of hatching such an egg!

2157
02:09:46,441 --> 02:09:48,476
How dare you sit next to me?

2158
02:09:48,610 --> 02:09:49,477
No, Bhava.

2159
02:09:50,478 --> 02:09:51,479
- Get lost!
- No, Bhavani.

2160
02:09:52,847 --> 02:09:55,183
Bhavani, boys want a booze party.

2161
02:09:55,316 --> 02:09:56,351
You won't drink anyway.

2162
02:09:56,684 --> 02:09:57,819
At least for them--

2163
02:09:59,520 --> 02:10:00,688
Drink to your death.

2164
02:10:01,523 --> 02:10:03,224
- Go ahead.
- Thanks a lot, Bhavani.

2165
02:10:04,526 --> 02:10:06,394
- Goodnight, Bhava.
- Goodnight.

2166
02:10:10,398 --> 02:10:12,100
Somehow you made me
show you this place.

2167
02:10:12,600 --> 02:10:14,736
I was staying away
from this place.

2168
02:10:14,903 --> 02:10:16,271
Let's go back, master.

2169
02:10:17,138 --> 02:10:19,107
Wait, I have a good reason.

2170
02:10:19,274 --> 02:10:20,141
We'll go soon.

2171
02:10:20,308 --> 02:10:22,810
Right, you haven't come here to eat.

2172
02:10:22,977 --> 02:10:26,981
- What happened to my chicken 'pakoda'?
- Narayana, serve him.

2173
02:10:27,315 --> 02:10:30,251
I thought you were inviting me
for a candle light dinner.

2174
02:10:30,351 --> 02:10:32,253
Last time I came here,
there was no power.

2175
02:10:32,353 --> 02:10:33,688
They had lit only candles.

2176
02:10:36,024 --> 02:10:37,692
Okay, relax.

2177
02:10:38,693 --> 02:10:40,228
Don't be disappointed with the place.

2178
02:10:41,062 --> 02:10:42,897
I heard the food here is incredible.

2179
02:10:44,232 --> 02:10:45,767
Get a token for the meals.

2180
02:10:46,601 --> 02:10:47,435
Madam, you too.

2181
02:10:48,603 --> 02:10:49,938
I thought we'll have some privacy.

2182
02:10:50,104 --> 02:10:53,641
Close your eyes and
show me your right hand.

2183
02:10:54,309 --> 02:10:56,311
- Why?
- Show, I'll tell you.

2184
02:11:00,348 --> 02:11:02,650
You shouldn't open your eyes
till I tell you to.

2185
02:11:05,687 --> 02:11:06,521
Open now.

2186
02:11:10,191 --> 02:11:12,694
That boy in the salon
had the same mark.

2187
02:11:12,861 --> 02:11:13,895
Show this over there.

2188
02:11:14,896 --> 02:11:16,064
And ask for meals token.

2189
02:11:18,266 --> 02:11:19,234
Why should I--

2190
02:11:19,434 --> 02:11:21,603
All for a good reason.
Go and show your hand.

2191
02:11:56,237 --> 02:11:57,438
Who the hell is he?

2192
02:12:16,224 --> 02:12:17,725
We don't differentiate or discriminate.

2193
02:12:19,394 --> 02:12:21,396
Whoever has the Tamil letter 'pa'
tattooed on their hands,

2194
02:12:21,863 --> 02:12:23,398
we'll give them whatever they ask for.

2195
02:12:26,935 --> 02:12:28,436
Bhavani's boys take care of the rest.

2196
02:12:40,682 --> 02:12:41,516
What is this for?

2197
02:12:42,317 --> 02:12:43,685
Still some balance left
in my bucket list!

2198
02:13:06,107 --> 02:13:10,478
<i>Let the drums beat, no restraint
Let the party rock, no constraint</i>

2199
02:13:10,979 --> 02:13:15,583
<i>Let our army smash and slam
Our earth will quake with the wham</i>

2200
02:13:15,683 --> 02:13:20,355
<i>My hands will never miss a beat
When I beat the drum ever so neat</i>

2201
02:13:20,688 --> 02:13:24,225
<i>Even the dormant nerve will dance
Hearing my drum's resonance</i>

2202
02:13:24,359 --> 02:13:25,193
Beat it!

2203
02:13:25,860 --> 02:13:30,231
<i>Till the sun rises to a new day
Let the ground shake and sway</i>

2204
02:13:30,565 --> 02:13:35,236
<i>Till the game is won, job is done
Slow down but have your fun</i>

2205
02:13:35,603 --> 02:13:39,140
<i>Even the Lord of Death Yama will die
If he glares with his razor sharp eye</i>

2206
02:13:39,274 --> 02:13:40,275
Hey boy!

2207
02:13:40,308 --> 02:13:44,279
<i>Light the camphor for our Lord
He is possessed by our demi-god</i>

2208
02:13:45,313 --> 02:13:49,851
<i>Look high and low diligently
Every nook and corner and alley</i>

2209
02:13:50,184 --> 02:13:54,022
<i>There is no other big gun to defy
Or create a ruckus and vilify</i>

2210
02:13:54,189 --> 02:13:55,190
Bhavani!

2211
02:14:09,103 --> 02:14:11,439
That master is churning in my mind.

2212
02:14:12,440 --> 02:14:14,642
Tell him to kill that master
tomorrow before daybreak.

2213
02:14:15,143 --> 02:14:18,313
Why wait till tomorrow morning?
We can finish him off right now.

2214
02:14:21,683 --> 02:14:22,684
Shut up and just do what I say!

2215
02:14:26,521 --> 02:14:30,725
<i>Let the force of his punching fist
Make the drumhead rip and split</i>

2216
02:14:31,359 --> 02:14:35,563
<i>Let 'sound' listen to the thump and lo!
Announce who struck the blow</i>

2217
02:14:39,934 --> 02:14:40,902
<i>You there!</i>

2218
02:14:40,935 --> 02:14:45,874
<i>Let the force of his punching fist
Make the drumhead rip and split</i>

2219
02:14:45,974 --> 02:14:50,311
<i>Let 'sound' listen to the thump and lo!
Announce who struck the blow</i>

2220
02:14:50,812 --> 02:14:54,849
<i>Shaking his stupor, without a doubt
He is all set to rip your gut out</i>

2221
02:14:55,016 --> 02:14:59,420
<i>To hang you upside down
And skin you alive is his vow</i>

2222
02:14:59,520 --> 02:15:00,688
<i>Master!</i>

2223
02:15:10,932 --> 02:15:15,270
<i>Let the drums roll, no restraint
Let the party rock, no constraint</i>

2224
02:15:15,904 --> 02:15:20,141
<i>Let our army smash and slam
Our earth will quake with the wham</i>

2225
02:15:20,808 --> 02:15:25,480
<i>My hands will never miss a beat
When I beat the drum, it's a royal treat</i>

2226
02:15:25,513 --> 02:15:29,083
<i>Even the dormant nerve will dance
Hearing my drum's resonance</i>

2227
02:15:29,183 --> 02:15:30,351
<i>Rock and roll</i>

2228
02:15:30,685 --> 02:15:35,223
<i>Till the sun rises to a new day
Let the ground shake and sway.</i>

2229
02:15:36,524 --> 02:15:37,559
Give me Dinkie Dow if you have.

2230
02:15:38,059 --> 02:15:39,394
I don't stock drugs.

2231
02:15:40,562 --> 02:15:44,065
<i>Even the Lord of Death Yama will die
If he glares with his razor sharp eye</i>

2232
02:15:44,265 --> 02:15:45,233
<i>Hey, Boy</i>

2233
02:15:45,266 --> 02:15:49,103
<i>Light the camphor for our Lord
He is possessed by our demi-god</i>

2234
02:16:16,231 --> 02:16:18,266
<i>Got the man with the plan right here</i>

2235
02:16:18,566 --> 02:16:20,268
<i>Bringin' swag with the man right here</i>

2236
02:16:21,269 --> 02:16:24,606
Forward all the videos
to the police department.

2237
02:16:25,273 --> 02:16:28,643
I'll bring the boys
to the Magistrate directly.

2238
02:16:29,110 --> 02:16:29,944
Okay.

2239
02:16:31,613 --> 02:16:32,347
Master.

2240
02:16:33,147 --> 02:16:34,682
That is Bhavani's truck.

2241
02:16:35,183 --> 02:16:37,518
I've heard he comes here often.

2242
02:16:39,520 --> 02:16:40,355
Let's go there.

2243
02:16:40,522 --> 02:16:43,057
Are you joking, Master?

2244
02:16:43,224 --> 02:16:45,226
I am not coming.
You go if you want to.

2245
02:16:48,930 --> 02:16:52,100
<i>A whole night of merry-making</i>

2246
02:16:52,267 --> 02:16:54,936
<i>Day spent in sleep overtaking</i>

2247
02:16:55,937 --> 02:17:02,143
<i>This is the world we rejoice
Reveling in unforbidden joys</i>

2248
02:17:03,311 --> 02:17:08,182
<i>A whole night of merry-making
Day spent in sleep overtaking</i>

2249
02:17:08,316 --> 02:17:14,189
<i>This is the world we rejoice
Reveling in unforbidden joys</i>

2250
02:17:18,393 --> 02:17:23,398
<i>A whole night of merry-making
Day spent in sleep overtaking</i>

2251
02:17:25,099 --> 02:17:30,271
<i>This is our universe
for better or worse</i>

2252
02:17:30,638 --> 02:17:32,807
If you move, I'll stab you.

2253
02:17:32,974 --> 02:17:33,808
Walk straight ahead.

2254
02:17:42,016 --> 02:17:43,818
<i>What existed before birth</i>

2255
02:17:44,352 --> 02:17:45,186
Knock the door.

2256
02:17:45,687 --> 02:17:47,188
<i>Even you can't unearth</i>

2257
02:17:49,224 --> 02:17:50,725
A secret code too!

2258
02:17:50,859 --> 02:17:55,396
<i>What happens after we die
Even I don't know the right reply</i>

2259
02:17:57,098 --> 02:17:59,267
If any hand reaches out to his weapon,

2260
02:18:00,235 --> 02:18:01,269
he will be a corpse.

2261
02:18:02,070 --> 02:18:02,904
Kneel, man.

2262
02:18:04,272 --> 02:18:05,974
- Kneel down.
- Switch off the song.

2263
02:18:07,308 --> 02:18:08,142
Switch it off!

2264
02:18:11,813 --> 02:18:12,981
Who is Bhavani here?

2265
02:18:16,184 --> 02:18:18,186
Which one of you here
has seen Bhavani?

2266
02:18:34,602 --> 02:18:36,271
What kind of sissy name
is Bhavani?

2267
02:18:36,771 --> 02:18:38,773
Was he lying on his stomach
as a baby when he was named?

2268
02:18:44,112 --> 02:18:44,946
Very good!

2269
02:18:46,147 --> 02:18:47,982
Let me make it clear once again.

2270
02:18:48,816 --> 02:18:52,020
If any of you does something stupid,

2271
02:18:52,687 --> 02:18:55,023
I'll cut your man's
Adam's apple, got it?

2272
02:18:55,690 --> 02:18:57,225
Try your luck flinging another bottle?

2273
02:18:58,226 --> 02:18:59,060
That means

2274
02:18:59,894 --> 02:19:01,863
you know Bhavani very well.

2275
02:19:04,265 --> 02:19:06,100
Will you go and repeat this
to him verbatim?

2276
02:19:08,570 --> 02:19:09,771
Bhavani, Bhavani.

2277
02:19:11,306 --> 02:19:12,807
Bhavani, Bhavani.

2278
02:19:14,609 --> 02:19:16,978
A man walked right in
knowing it is your den, Bhavani.

2279
02:19:18,613 --> 02:19:19,347
Repeat.

2280
02:19:20,148 --> 02:19:21,683
No, you tell me.
I'll convey the same.

2281
02:19:21,983 --> 02:19:24,519
No, you are scared.

2282
02:19:25,687 --> 02:19:28,189
Listen, I might as well tell all of you.

2283
02:19:28,223 --> 02:19:31,292
The day you killed those two boys at
the Observation Home and hung them,

2284
02:19:31,392 --> 02:19:33,228
I hung my head in guilt and died.

2285
02:19:33,728 --> 02:19:35,563
I'm least bothered about myself hereafter.

2286
02:19:36,898 --> 02:19:40,335
Branding those juveniles with a tattoo
and making them do your dirty work.

2287
02:19:40,435 --> 02:19:41,502
I've put a full stop to it.

2288
02:19:41,603 --> 02:19:44,939
From now on, anyone wants to do anything
using the boys as lambs for the slaughter

2289
02:19:44,973 --> 02:19:47,809
has to kill me and then go ahead
but that has a slight hitch.

2290
02:19:48,643 --> 02:19:52,480
I will kill minimum ten of you
and only then breathe my last.

2291
02:19:53,848 --> 02:19:57,018
Be it Bhavani or Banumathi!

2292
02:19:58,686 --> 02:20:00,021
Will you go and tell him
word by word?

2293
02:20:01,389 --> 02:20:02,524
Come, get up.

2294
02:20:08,196 --> 02:20:08,930
Close the door.

2295
02:20:26,648 --> 02:20:28,016
Who threw that bottle at me?

2296
02:20:30,852 --> 02:20:31,686
Come here.

2297
02:20:31,853 --> 02:20:33,187
No, Bhavani.

2298
02:20:33,354 --> 02:20:35,190
I aimed it at him.

2299
02:20:35,390 --> 02:20:38,059
I thought the pen will fall down
and you will escape.

2300
02:20:38,193 --> 02:20:39,227
But I missed and--

2301
02:20:39,894 --> 02:20:41,563
Hey! Open the door!

2302
02:20:41,696 --> 02:20:42,730
- Open the door.
- Madcap!

2303
02:20:42,897 --> 02:20:44,933
- Open the door.
- What false bravado!

2304
02:20:45,266 --> 02:20:47,268
Son of a scumbag!
Open it, damn you.

2305
02:20:47,402 --> 02:20:49,571
Where did you go?
Open now, I'll kill you.

2306
02:20:49,604 --> 02:20:51,439
- Hey! Open.
- Okay, sir.

2307
02:20:51,472 --> 02:20:53,041
How dare you lay a hand
on Bhavani when I'm here?

2308
02:20:53,141 --> 02:20:54,142
- Kottamuthu.
- Come now.

2309
02:20:54,275 --> 02:20:56,110
- Hey Kottamuthu.
- What did you think of us?

2310
02:20:56,144 --> 02:20:57,145
Brother is calling you.

2311
02:20:57,979 --> 02:20:58,813
Come here.

2312
02:21:00,682 --> 02:21:03,017
- What are you doing?
- He locked us in.

2313
02:21:03,818 --> 02:21:05,587
He was holding a knife
to my neck for an hour.

2314
02:21:05,687 --> 02:21:07,088
What the heck
were you doing then?

2315
02:21:07,188 --> 02:21:09,390
Bhavani, that wasn't a knife.

2316
02:21:09,557 --> 02:21:11,893
- It was a pen.
- You knew it, huh?

2317
02:21:12,060 --> 02:21:14,729
How will he open the door
if you yell after he has gone?

2318
02:21:14,896 --> 02:21:16,231
Shall we pen him a letter?

2319
02:21:16,564 --> 02:21:17,899
Sir, please open the door.

2320
02:21:21,436 --> 02:21:22,604
Don't hit me, Bhavani.

2321
02:21:30,111 --> 02:21:31,145
Who can draw well here?

2322
02:21:31,312 --> 02:21:32,814
Master, he is our best artist.

2323
02:21:32,847 --> 02:21:36,017
He's the madcap who doodles foul stuff
all over the toilet and the walls, Master.

2324
02:21:38,353 --> 02:21:39,187
Hi, Master.

2325
02:21:39,354 --> 02:21:41,055
I believe you came into my den.

2326
02:21:41,189 --> 02:21:44,058
Threatened a man with a pen and
conveyed an important message to Bhavani.

2327
02:21:44,392 --> 02:21:45,727
I am that Bhavani.

2328
02:21:45,894 --> 02:21:46,861
<i>Greetings.</i>

2329
02:21:46,895 --> 02:21:51,432
If you destroy all that I own,
textile shop, hotel, wine shop,

2330
02:21:52,100 --> 02:21:55,436
what the hell will I do?
I'm a criminal after all, right?

2331
02:21:55,603 --> 02:21:57,639
<i>You assumed I wouldn't
go to the police.</i>

2332
02:21:57,772 --> 02:21:59,140
Your assumption is 100% right.

2333
02:21:59,807 --> 02:22:01,142
But thinking you'll make
a fool of me was wrong.

2334
02:22:01,776 --> 02:22:02,977
<i>I enquired about you.</i>

2335
02:22:03,144 --> 02:22:05,580
I believe you have a big gang
of ardent fan followers.

2336
02:22:05,647 --> 02:22:08,182
<i>Which one of them can I finish off?
I asked my boys their choice.</i>

2337
02:22:08,516 --> 02:22:11,519
They said, "We can have a jolly time
killing them all without discrimination."

2338
02:22:11,986 --> 02:22:14,689
<i>Let me give you a task.
Take a pen and paper.</i>

2339
02:22:14,856 --> 02:22:18,793
List out your favorites
in alphabetical order.

2340
02:22:18,893 --> 02:22:20,061
Bhavani!

2341
02:22:20,195 --> 02:22:22,730
Don't ignore girls and kids
thinking I'll be soft on them.

2342
02:22:23,231 --> 02:22:24,933
Include their names too, okay?

2343
02:22:25,266 --> 02:22:27,268
<i>Write and call each one of them.</i>

2344
02:22:27,602 --> 02:22:29,270
And then, Master!

2345
02:22:29,771 --> 02:22:31,105
Sir!

2346
02:22:31,272 --> 02:22:32,106
Give me the phone.

2347
02:22:32,640 --> 02:22:33,474
Hello?

2348
02:22:34,142 --> 02:22:35,944
- Why did he hang up on me?
- Must have got scared.

2349
02:22:36,144 --> 02:22:37,478
Got very emotional I guess.

2350
02:22:38,446 --> 02:22:41,182
Why do emotional men
get so hyper and angry?

2351
02:22:47,188 --> 02:22:48,890
Pick, pick, pick up my call.

2352
02:22:54,062 --> 02:22:54,896
Pick up.

2353
02:22:55,396 --> 02:22:56,564
- Hi, Dude.
- Where are you?

2354
02:22:56,598 --> 02:22:57,832
I'm just leaving my office.

2355
02:22:57,932 --> 02:22:59,601
- You are safe?
- Yes, what's the problem?

2356
02:22:59,767 --> 02:23:01,502
<i>Listen to me.
Don't step out.</i>

2357
02:23:01,603 --> 02:23:02,904
What is the problem--

2358
02:23:04,105 --> 02:23:05,440
Come on, pick up.

2359
02:23:06,307 --> 02:23:07,475
- Sir?
- Where are you?

2360
02:23:07,609 --> 02:23:09,043
- Shut up--<i>-I hope you're safe?</i>

2361
02:23:09,143 --> 02:23:10,311
<i>- Yes, sir, what happened?</i>
- Listen.

2362
02:23:11,112 --> 02:23:13,314
Check if our batch students
are safe, okay?

2363
02:23:13,348 --> 02:23:15,083
- Okay, sir.<i>-Madhi, where is Srinath?</i>

2364
02:23:15,183 --> 02:23:15,984
He is here, JD.

2365
02:23:16,017 --> 02:23:17,819
- What is it?
- Stay at home, don't go out.

2366
02:23:17,852 --> 02:23:19,020
Everything safe?

2367
02:23:19,153 --> 02:23:20,154
JD called me.

2368
02:23:20,188 --> 02:23:21,523
He was so hassled.

2369
02:23:21,689 --> 02:23:23,391
<i>He told us not to step out.</i>

2370
02:23:23,558 --> 02:23:26,361
Guys, don't step out of your house.
Most importantly avoid road travel.

2371
02:23:26,394 --> 02:23:30,064
<i>In case you are out, go to any house
or shop nearby or any safe place.</i>

2372
02:23:30,231 --> 02:23:32,567
<i>JD sir called just now.
I think there's a major problem.</i>

2373
02:23:32,600 --> 02:23:33,935
<i>If you are safe,</i>

2374
02:23:34,102 --> 02:23:36,004
for heaven's sake
text our entire group.

2375
02:23:36,104 --> 02:23:36,938
Park the bike.

2376
02:23:40,608 --> 02:23:42,810
<i>Almost everyone in the group
texted they are safe.</i>

2377
02:23:42,977 --> 02:23:45,280
But we couldn't reach
Bhargav and Savitha, sir.

2378
02:23:45,980 --> 02:23:47,348
Don't swerve too much to the right.

2379
02:23:47,849 --> 02:23:48,683
Careful!

2380
02:23:52,687 --> 02:23:53,521
Hello?

2381
02:23:53,855 --> 02:23:54,689
I am safe--

2382
02:23:57,725 --> 02:23:58,793
Vanathi, where are you?

2383
02:23:58,893 --> 02:24:00,461
In a mall nearby.
What happened?

2384
02:24:00,562 --> 02:24:02,230
- Is Prem with you?
- Yes.

2385
02:24:02,397 --> 02:24:04,065
He has gone to fetch
my purse from the car--

2386
02:24:06,267 --> 02:24:07,168
<i>Vanathi, what is it?</i>

2387
02:24:07,268 --> 02:24:08,269
What happened, Vanathi?

2388
02:24:08,770 --> 02:24:10,271
Vanathi, talk to me.
What is it?

2389
02:24:12,273 --> 02:24:13,474
Vanathi.

2390
02:24:14,108 --> 02:24:16,144
<i>- Where are you?</i>
- Theatre. Why, sir?

2391
02:24:16,311 --> 02:24:17,478
- Are you alright?
- What happened?

2392
02:24:17,645 --> 02:24:18,813
Sir!

2393
02:24:18,846 --> 02:24:19,847
Sri!

2394
02:24:21,182 --> 02:24:22,016
Sir!

2395
02:24:23,518 --> 02:24:24,352
Hey!

2396
02:24:25,520 --> 02:24:26,855
Hey! Get out.

2397
02:24:26,988 --> 02:24:28,356
- What happened?
- Savitha, go.

2398
02:24:28,857 --> 02:24:29,691
Bhargav.

2399
02:24:30,225 --> 02:24:32,360
Bhargav!

2400
02:24:32,560 --> 02:24:33,394
Bhargav.

2401
02:24:34,195 --> 02:24:35,029
Sir!

2402
02:24:37,599 --> 02:24:38,433
Sir!

2403
02:24:41,269 --> 02:24:43,271
Bhargav is dead, sir.

2404
02:25:12,433 --> 02:25:14,102
<i>Got the man with the plan right here</i>

2405
02:25:14,602 --> 02:25:15,770
<i>Bringin' swag with the--</i>

2406
02:25:16,604 --> 02:25:17,438
Master.

2407
02:25:18,273 --> 02:25:19,140
How many wickets down?

2408
02:25:19,941 --> 02:25:21,209
<i>According to the news I got,</i>

2409
02:25:21,309 --> 02:25:22,944
two wickets down and two retired hurt.

2410
02:25:23,978 --> 02:25:26,648
If you are still stubborn enough
to hang out with that gang,

2411
02:25:27,315 --> 02:25:28,349
you'll lose 4 wickets daily.

2412
02:25:29,017 --> 02:25:31,352
<i>I have never forgiven anyone
who has crossed my path till now.</i>

2413
02:25:32,020 --> 02:25:33,688
This is my first time
and I am forgiving you.

2414
02:25:34,522 --> 02:25:37,725
Quit your job,
and leave this town.

2415
02:25:38,560 --> 02:25:41,396
Otherwise, the ones who escaped today
will die tomorrow.

2416
02:25:41,529 --> 02:25:43,097
And it will go on and on and on.

2417
02:25:43,231 --> 02:25:45,266
They will keep falling like ninepins.
Thank you and good bye.

2418
02:25:45,600 --> 02:25:47,101
Hey! Master, master.

2419
02:25:47,602 --> 02:25:49,070
<i>The main reason I called you</i>

2420
02:25:49,604 --> 02:25:51,439
was to tell you that I didn't lie
face down when I was named.

2421
02:25:52,106 --> 02:25:53,641
I was on my back,
it was clear as a bell!

2422
02:25:53,775 --> 02:25:55,276
- Hey!
- Yes.

2423
02:25:55,310 --> 02:25:57,645
- Hey!
- Yes.

2424
02:25:58,112 --> 02:26:00,481
I'll flay you.

2425
02:26:01,149 --> 02:26:02,350
Alright, come on then.

2426
02:26:07,188 --> 02:26:09,390
Take care of them just for today.

2427
02:26:09,891 --> 02:26:10,725
I'll be back soon.

2428
02:26:10,892 --> 02:26:11,893
Don't worry, you go.

2429
02:26:12,393 --> 02:26:14,062
<i>I will ensure the safety of these boys.</i>

2430
02:26:18,099 --> 02:26:20,668
- Let go of me, brother.
- Shut up and get in the truck.

2431
02:26:20,768 --> 02:26:22,503
- Brother, let go of me.
- I'm going to hit you.

2432
02:26:22,604 --> 02:26:23,771
Where are you taking me?

2433
02:26:23,805 --> 02:26:25,807
- I'm not coming, Brother.
- Das!

2434
02:26:26,941 --> 02:26:28,142
Hey! Come here.

2435
02:26:28,276 --> 02:26:29,644
Das, he's throwing a tantrum.

2436
02:26:29,811 --> 02:26:31,646
- Lift him.
- Don't force me, Brother.

2437
02:26:31,813 --> 02:26:33,314
- No, no.
- Bloody, listen to me.

2438
02:26:33,348 --> 02:26:35,083
Save me, Warden.

2439
02:26:35,183 --> 02:26:36,351
Don't do this, Das.

2440
02:26:36,484 --> 02:26:37,852
Help us, Warden.

2441
02:26:38,152 --> 02:26:40,021
- Don't take them.
- Let me go, Brother.

2442
02:26:40,522 --> 02:26:41,356
Move it.

2443
02:26:41,689 --> 02:26:45,059
Das! Where are you taking the boys?

2444
02:26:56,271 --> 02:26:58,606
<i>Hello, sir,
I'm Thulukanam speaking.</i>

2445
02:26:58,640 --> 02:27:01,276
<i>Das and his boys have
locked us up in here.</i>

2446
02:27:01,309 --> 02:27:03,211
<i>He has taken the boys
who turned approvers</i>

2447
02:27:03,311 --> 02:27:04,646
<i>in a truck, sir.</i>

2448
02:27:04,812 --> 02:27:06,981
<i>We don't know what to do.
Please come soon, sir.</i>

2449
02:27:25,266 --> 02:27:26,100
Yes, Vanathi.

2450
02:27:38,613 --> 02:27:40,682
This is not the end of the world for us.

2451
02:27:42,016 --> 02:27:43,685
You have done enough
for these boys.

2452
02:27:44,519 --> 02:27:47,689
I have informed the higher authorities.
They said they will be here soon.

2453
02:27:48,189 --> 02:27:51,125
<i>He was chewing betel leaves in bliss
I punched his nose without a miss</i>

2454
02:27:51,226 --> 02:27:54,062
<i>You should have seen blood gush out
This Amaran's heart is gold, no doubt</i>

2455
02:27:57,599 --> 02:27:59,100
<i>Master, please take this.</i>

2456
02:27:59,567 --> 02:28:01,102
I don't care two hoots
about the repercussion.

2457
02:28:01,236 --> 02:28:03,938
I'll take full blame.
Beat the hell out of them.

2458
02:28:04,606 --> 02:28:05,874
Hold this.

2459
02:28:05,940 --> 02:28:08,142
<i>It's a lilting tune anyone can hum</i>

2460
02:28:08,309 --> 02:28:10,979
<i>Amaran is a seasoned singer awesome</i>

2461
02:28:11,479 --> 02:28:14,349
<i>He was chewing betel leaves in bliss
I punched his nose without a miss</i>

2462
02:28:14,482 --> 02:28:17,085
<i>Should have seen his nose bleed
This Amaran's heart is gold indee-</i>

2463
02:28:17,185 --> 02:28:18,019
Hey, master is here.

2464
02:28:18,486 --> 02:28:19,354
Back again?

2465
02:28:20,688 --> 02:28:21,523
Stop it.

2466
02:28:22,891 --> 02:28:24,192
Are you going to hit us?

2467
02:28:24,392 --> 02:28:25,226
Go ahead.

2468
02:28:32,767 --> 02:28:33,601
Come here.

2469
02:28:34,936 --> 02:28:36,971
Think you've achieved
something great in life.

2470
02:28:38,806 --> 02:28:39,974
Shout all you want.

2471
02:28:41,609 --> 02:28:42,443
Hey.

2472
02:28:44,145 --> 02:28:44,979
Bhargav.

2473
02:28:46,481 --> 02:28:47,315
He is dead.

2474
02:28:53,021 --> 02:28:55,890
Bhargav created more trouble
in college than all of you put together.

2475
02:28:56,558 --> 02:28:57,859
He is dead now.

2476
02:28:58,059 --> 02:29:02,597
If a real rowdy reforms and just when
he wants to lead a good life, if he dies--

2477
02:29:03,398 --> 02:29:05,099
Do you know how cruel that is?

2478
02:29:05,767 --> 02:29:08,436
The faith people around him have
to turn over a new leaf will vanish.

2479
02:29:08,603 --> 02:29:09,904
Oh, my God!

2480
02:29:10,271 --> 02:29:12,040
Master has started preaching us.

2481
02:29:12,106 --> 02:29:12,941
Ignore them, Brother.

2482
02:29:13,308 --> 02:29:15,476
Why do you treat them
on an equal footing with you?

2483
02:29:15,610 --> 02:29:17,145
These mongrels won't reform
even if they die!

2484
02:29:17,312 --> 02:29:19,013
Who will reform?

2485
02:29:19,814 --> 02:29:22,250
When have we treated him with respect?

2486
02:29:22,350 --> 02:29:24,519
Or given him time, place
or an opportunity to reform?

2487
02:29:25,520 --> 02:29:28,189
Undiyal, Odacha Kadalai, Bottle Mani,
Soda Sekar, what kind of names?

2488
02:29:28,523 --> 02:29:30,892
Then how will they remember
their family or tender love and care?

2489
02:29:32,393 --> 02:29:34,395
Family and society alienate them.

2490
02:29:34,529 --> 02:29:36,231
If everybody has exiled him,
how will he reform?

2491
02:29:39,434 --> 02:29:40,268
Come here.

2492
02:29:40,902 --> 02:29:41,736
What?

2493
02:29:42,904 --> 02:29:45,607
The first crime committed by many here
is an emotional one.

2494
02:29:46,774 --> 02:29:48,643
Affection, betrayal, anger,
or a rush of adrenalin.

2495
02:29:48,810 --> 02:29:49,811
Each with a reason.

2496
02:29:51,145 --> 02:29:52,347
But after the first time.

2497
02:29:52,480 --> 02:29:56,317
You know what instigates you to commit
every crime you pile on to your account?

2498
02:29:57,352 --> 02:29:58,186
Intoxication!

2499
02:30:01,389 --> 02:30:02,724
I can bet on this.

2500
02:30:03,391 --> 02:30:06,561
All other crimes after your first was
committed losing control of your senses.

2501
02:30:06,728 --> 02:30:08,530
Didn't you booze?
Didn't you have a ball?

2502
02:30:08,897 --> 02:30:09,731
Oh! Yes, sir.

2503
02:30:10,398 --> 02:30:11,599
Open up your warped mind!

2504
02:30:11,766 --> 02:30:13,735
Only a drunkard can talk
of how it ruined his family.

2505
02:30:14,602 --> 02:30:15,770
Only because of my addiction

2506
02:30:17,272 --> 02:30:19,107
two boys lost their lives
I got that into my thick head.

2507
02:30:20,141 --> 02:30:21,142
I quit drinking.

2508
02:30:21,309 --> 02:30:23,811
Don't be such a drama queen, master!

2509
02:30:24,112 --> 02:30:25,346
Am I brewing liquor at home?

2510
02:30:25,513 --> 02:30:26,981
Blaming the buyer
instead of the seller!

2511
02:30:27,315 --> 02:30:30,485
That's exactly what I'm saying.
This intoxication is a political game.

2512
02:30:31,686 --> 02:30:34,189
You are not yet 18 years.
You can't watch this adult film.

2513
02:30:34,222 --> 02:30:36,391
A security guard stands out
to push you out, right?

2514
02:30:36,558 --> 02:30:38,726
Why is no one standing guard
outside a wine shop?

2515
02:30:38,893 --> 02:30:41,896
How do 10-15 years old get hold
of a booze bottle and cigarette?

2516
02:30:43,932 --> 02:30:44,766
Politics.

2517
02:30:46,935 --> 02:30:49,270
Bhavani is moving his pawn
and playing this kind of politics.

2518
02:30:50,104 --> 02:30:52,440
When the law is against child labor

2519
02:30:52,473 --> 02:30:55,476
that beast is forcing the same boys
into nefarious activities.

2520
02:30:59,647 --> 02:31:00,481
What is this?

2521
02:31:01,516 --> 02:31:02,350
What is it?

2522
02:31:02,850 --> 02:31:05,486
Like bribing you to vote and
you end up with an inked finger.

2523
02:31:05,653 --> 02:31:08,189
He gives you freebies
and brands you with a tattoo.

2524
02:31:09,557 --> 02:31:13,194
He has bathed you in basic amenities
providing free food and clothing.

2525
02:31:16,231 --> 02:31:17,765
Good Lord!

2526
02:31:19,400 --> 02:31:20,735
Enough of this atrocity.

2527
02:31:21,269 --> 02:31:25,273
You have packed those boys who believed
they have a good future into that truck.

2528
02:31:26,808 --> 02:31:29,143
Don't know if they will hang from a fan
or be run over by a vehicle.

2529
02:31:30,645 --> 02:31:31,479
But...

2530
02:31:32,513 --> 02:31:33,481
I will save them.

2531
02:31:34,515 --> 02:31:36,017
Every single one of them.

2532
02:31:42,857 --> 02:31:43,892
What did he say?

2533
02:31:44,692 --> 02:31:46,861
He will kill all those who like me?

2534
02:31:47,395 --> 02:31:48,229
Hey!

2535
02:31:51,432 --> 02:31:53,768
There are billions outside who like me.

2536
02:31:57,105 --> 02:31:58,606
Ask him to try his luck.

2537
02:32:02,477 --> 02:32:08,149
Brother, Bhavani has loaded the documents,
and money of his 'benamis' in his lorries.

2538
02:32:08,182 --> 02:32:10,351
He is planning to
cross the border tonight.

2539
02:32:11,185 --> 02:32:13,021
The boys are
in one of the trucks, Brother.

2540
02:32:24,098 --> 02:32:24,933
Bhavani.

2541
02:32:25,433 --> 02:32:27,101
All 40 lorries have crossed the border.

2542
02:32:27,268 --> 02:32:28,436
Expected anytime now.

2543
02:32:29,771 --> 02:32:30,605
Those boys?

2544
02:32:31,439 --> 02:32:33,308
Das is bringing them in the container.

2545
02:34:00,562 --> 02:34:01,396
Go.

2546
02:34:38,266 --> 02:34:39,267
Finish her off!

2547
02:34:42,604 --> 02:34:44,939
Vanathi. Vanathi.

2548
02:34:46,975 --> 02:34:47,976
Run over her.

2549
02:34:49,143 --> 02:34:49,978
Vanathi.

2550
02:34:58,019 --> 02:34:58,853
Vanathi, take the wheel.

2551
02:36:12,227 --> 02:36:13,895
Come... come.

2552
02:36:49,731 --> 02:36:51,065
Bang his car and kill them.

2553
02:37:10,485 --> 02:37:11,519
Come... come.

2554
02:37:12,487 --> 02:37:13,321
Stop... stop.

2555
02:37:15,190 --> 02:37:17,959
If those 15 boys turn approvers,
whom will they point their fingers at?

2556
02:37:18,059 --> 02:37:19,060
Das, of course.

2557
02:37:19,227 --> 02:37:20,728
They have never met you, Bhavani.

2558
02:37:21,529 --> 02:37:22,730
What if Das turns approver?

2559
02:37:29,437 --> 02:37:30,438
Your name, Bhavani.

2560
02:37:31,105 --> 02:37:32,140
Then kill Das.

2561
02:37:57,265 --> 02:37:58,099
Go.

2562
02:37:58,266 --> 02:37:59,100
Go.

2563
02:38:00,735 --> 02:38:02,937
Are you asking him
to get rid of me?

2564
02:38:03,104 --> 02:38:04,606
Your words came to my mind.

2565
02:38:05,440 --> 02:38:07,141
I can give up my life for you.

2566
02:38:08,142 --> 02:38:08,977
Give it up now.

2567
02:38:12,146 --> 02:38:13,815
I thought of you
as my own brother.

2568
02:38:15,316 --> 02:38:16,851
I regarded you as my elder brother.

2569
02:38:17,018 --> 02:38:19,020
Even I thought of you
as my younger brother.

2570
02:38:19,854 --> 02:38:21,055
What do you want me to do?

2571
02:38:21,222 --> 02:38:22,390
Where are the boys?

2572
02:38:23,858 --> 02:38:24,692
Where are they?

2573
02:38:26,194 --> 02:38:28,396
Hey! Go and check the container.

2574
02:38:30,899 --> 02:38:32,600
Go. Move it.

2575
02:38:47,515 --> 02:38:48,349
Bloody--

2576
02:38:49,851 --> 02:38:51,519
Let's see who wins.
You or me?

2577
02:38:51,819 --> 02:38:53,021
Das, listen to me.

2578
02:38:53,354 --> 02:38:54,889
Listen to me.
Just listen!

2579
02:38:56,391 --> 02:38:57,225
Hear me out.

2580
02:38:58,226 --> 02:39:01,396
Oral statement by all those boys
point fingers accusingly only at you.

2581
02:39:02,230 --> 02:39:04,432
They don't even know the name Bhavani.

2582
02:39:04,933 --> 02:39:06,167
Bhavani knows that too.

2583
02:39:06,267 --> 02:39:07,602
Give it a serious thought.

2584
02:39:07,769 --> 02:39:09,404
Will he kill all the boys?

2585
02:39:09,771 --> 02:39:12,473
Or kill the one they are pointing
fingers at, which is you?

2586
02:39:12,640 --> 02:39:14,976
- You deserve to die.
- In one swift blow, I'll--

2587
02:39:17,812 --> 02:39:19,314
That is not my intention.

2588
02:39:19,480 --> 02:39:21,683
Put an end to the killings.

2589
02:39:22,850 --> 02:39:24,185
I'm going to say it again.

2590
02:39:24,352 --> 02:39:25,320
Bhavani is very clever.

2591
02:39:25,353 --> 02:39:27,856
He won't kill the boys.
His target is you.

2592
02:39:29,390 --> 02:39:31,059
Listen to me once.
Only this time.

2593
02:39:31,726 --> 02:39:34,729
Ask him if you can bring the boys
in front of him. He will say no.

2594
02:39:35,396 --> 02:39:36,297
You insist on that, okay?

2595
02:39:36,397 --> 02:39:38,433
Then you'll know the true color
of Bhavani.

2596
02:39:39,434 --> 02:39:40,435
If this doesn't happen--

2597
02:39:43,404 --> 02:39:44,772
I am all yours to kill.

2598
02:41:39,354 --> 02:41:40,522
<i>Master</i>

2599
02:41:41,523 --> 02:41:42,891
<i>They call me master</i>

2600
02:41:44,392 --> 02:41:45,727
<i>You know me master</i>

2601
02:41:47,562 --> 02:41:49,130
<i>I am master the blaster</i>

2602
02:41:49,230 --> 02:41:50,498
<i>Oooh yeah!</i>

2603
02:41:50,598 --> 02:41:51,432
<i>Master</i>

2604
02:41:52,767 --> 02:41:54,269
<i>They call me master</i>

2605
02:41:56,771 --> 02:41:57,605
Welcome, Master.

2606
02:41:59,974 --> 02:42:02,143
This is the first time
we are meeting, right?

2607
02:42:06,814 --> 02:42:08,182
Loaded with emotion, huh?

2608
02:42:09,851 --> 02:42:10,685
My dear master.

2609
02:42:13,888 --> 02:42:15,723
Bhavani isn't just a name.

2610
02:42:17,058 --> 02:42:18,726
It's a kingdom I created for myself.

2611
02:42:19,394 --> 02:42:21,896
You can't create
a world record overnight.

2612
02:42:23,231 --> 02:42:25,433
If he was sharing his pearls of wisdom,
what about the mud between your ears?

2613
02:42:28,603 --> 02:42:29,938
You carried that boy on your waist?

2614
02:42:31,439 --> 02:42:32,607
Did you think they are kids?

2615
02:42:34,475 --> 02:42:35,977
They are killers of the worst kind.

2616
02:42:38,613 --> 02:42:40,215
I've already given you too much time.

2617
02:42:40,315 --> 02:42:41,683
Still I'll give you two minutes.

2618
02:42:42,684 --> 02:42:44,018
If you can--

2619
02:42:46,855 --> 02:42:48,923
Master, why did you hit me
while I was talking?

2620
02:42:49,023 --> 02:42:50,391
Didn't you ask for it?

2621
02:42:51,526 --> 02:42:52,360
Come.

2622
02:42:52,560 --> 02:42:53,895
Is this all the force you can muster?

2623
02:44:09,237 --> 02:44:10,238
Master.

2624
02:45:24,646 --> 02:45:28,016
- Master!
- Please get up, Master.

2625
02:45:29,350 --> 02:45:30,652
Job done and dusted.

2626
02:45:32,520 --> 02:45:34,189
Lord, pardon this sinner.

2627
02:45:40,228 --> 02:45:41,062
Don't!

2628
02:45:44,098 --> 02:45:47,101
Hey! I am fighting here for your sake.

2629
02:45:48,269 --> 02:45:50,772
So your hands don't grip
a knife once more.

2630
02:45:51,439 --> 02:45:52,273
Your mind.

2631
02:45:53,141 --> 02:45:54,976
Your mind should not
go back to its old way.

2632
02:45:55,143 --> 02:45:56,611
I am fighting your cause.

2633
02:45:56,644 --> 02:45:57,645
Not one of you.

2634
02:45:58,813 --> 02:46:00,682
Not even one of you
should raise his hand.

2635
02:46:02,517 --> 02:46:03,351
Step back.

2636
02:46:05,520 --> 02:46:06,354
Move back!

2637
02:46:10,692 --> 02:46:15,230
<i>O master, come to my den
If you don't, I'll force you then</i>

2638
02:46:16,731 --> 02:46:20,935
<i>In my own hot spot
you bet I'm a big shot</i>

2639
02:46:21,936 --> 02:46:22,770
How was it?

2640
02:46:23,438 --> 02:46:25,273
You're teaching a lesson
even while dying.

2641
02:46:25,640 --> 02:46:26,975
Is this your last lesson, master?

2642
02:46:28,476 --> 02:46:29,310
Come.

2643
02:47:07,148 --> 02:47:08,816
Shall we have it this way?

2644
02:47:18,893 --> 02:47:20,028
Show me your fist power.

2645
02:48:11,446 --> 02:48:12,981
- Hey, hey.
- Master.

2646
02:48:13,147 --> 02:48:15,817
- Take the boys to the truck.
- Okay, Master.

2647
02:48:16,317 --> 02:48:17,151
Hey, Das.

2648
02:48:45,480 --> 02:48:47,482
Bhavani. Bhavani.

2649
02:48:52,987 --> 02:48:56,090
<i>Come my well-wisher
Raw banana fritter</i>

2650
02:48:56,191 --> 02:48:59,294
<i>I will tear your body to tatters
Fry and serve as golden fritters</i>

2651
02:48:59,394 --> 02:49:02,664
<i>Come my well-wisher
Raw banana fritter</i>

2652
02:49:02,730 --> 02:49:05,433
<i>I will tear your body to tatters
Fry and serve as golden fritters</i>

2653
02:49:28,022 --> 02:49:29,557
Master... master... wait.

2654
02:49:32,727 --> 02:49:33,895
Sit down.

2655
02:49:38,900 --> 02:49:39,734
Master.

2656
02:49:41,102 --> 02:49:43,404
A problem won't be solved
by killing a person.

2657
02:49:43,771 --> 02:49:45,440
I asked a man this
when I was just 17.

2658
02:49:46,641 --> 02:49:48,142
And I'm going
to request you too.

2659
02:49:49,143 --> 02:49:50,445
Let me live.

2660
02:49:52,146 --> 02:49:53,481
I will do anything for you.

2661
02:49:54,182 --> 02:49:55,350
I won't harm those boys.

2662
02:49:56,150 --> 02:49:58,186
You are the one who made
those innocent children criminals.

2663
02:50:00,522 --> 02:50:01,356
One--

2664
02:50:02,857 --> 02:50:03,892
Only one year.

2665
02:50:04,893 --> 02:50:08,563
You were let into that Observation Home
and you've progressed so much in life.

2666
02:50:08,730 --> 02:50:12,267
If you are punished and sent to jail,
imagine what you'll do to this town.

2667
02:50:18,273 --> 02:50:19,274
I'll get into politics.

2668
02:50:20,975 --> 02:50:22,143
I'll start a party.

2669
02:50:23,278 --> 02:50:24,445
Will you join me?

2670
02:50:25,813 --> 02:50:26,648
Master.

2671
02:50:28,349 --> 02:50:29,183
What?

2672
02:50:57,645 --> 02:50:59,647
Job done!

2673
02:51:04,686 --> 02:51:09,057
<i>Let me sing a short story
Pay attention, listen to me</i>

2674
02:51:10,892 --> 02:51:15,230
<i>If you want, take it or else
No need tension, leave it, baby</i>

2675
02:51:17,065 --> 02:51:19,934
<i>Life is very short, buddy</i>

2676
02:51:20,101 --> 02:51:21,769
- Master.
- Who is that?

2677
02:51:23,938 --> 02:51:25,607
The boys are in the truck, Master.

2678
02:51:27,308 --> 02:51:28,810
Come here. Sit down.

2679
02:51:30,645 --> 02:51:31,479
Sit.

2680
02:51:37,018 --> 02:51:38,853
Shall I surrender instead of you?

2681
02:51:41,189 --> 02:51:43,024
Won't you understand till the very end?

2682
02:51:43,892 --> 02:51:46,394
Each person has to endure
the punishment according to his crime.

2683
02:51:47,896 --> 02:51:48,930
Madcap!

2684
02:51:49,063 --> 02:51:51,065
I feel I should do something for you.

2685
02:51:51,432 --> 02:51:53,268
Tell me if you have a family.
I'll take care of them till you're back.

2686
02:51:55,937 --> 02:51:59,140
I overheard the children
in the reformatory that you loved a girl.

2687
02:52:00,141 --> 02:52:02,110
A girl from an affluent family.
Already engaged to someone.

2688
02:52:03,444 --> 02:52:04,812
Shall I go and talk to her?

2689
02:52:06,648 --> 02:52:08,016
Maybe I can share my epic story!

2690
02:52:09,017 --> 02:52:10,318
Listen, my dear boy.

2691
02:52:11,686 --> 02:52:13,021
My name was not JD then.

2692
02:52:13,688 --> 02:52:14,689
Jack Daniels.

2693
02:52:15,690 --> 02:52:17,559
People called me Jack.

2694
02:52:18,526 --> 02:52:19,561
I used to draw well.

2695
02:52:19,727 --> 02:52:21,062
Good at card games.

2696
02:52:22,063 --> 02:52:25,900
In such a game we were lucky.
My friend and I won two tickets.

2697
02:52:27,068 --> 02:52:29,938
You would have seen everyone
run to catch a bus or train.

2698
02:52:30,605 --> 02:52:33,641
But imagine we ran and caught a ship
about to leave the dock.

2699
02:52:34,642 --> 02:52:35,476
Huh?

2700
02:52:36,644 --> 02:52:38,313
That's where I set eyes on her
for the very first time.

2701
02:52:39,647 --> 02:52:40,682
Her name was Rose.

2702
02:52:43,351 --> 02:52:44,686
What did you say her name was?

2703
02:52:45,853 --> 02:52:46,688
Rose.

2704
02:52:47,355 --> 02:52:48,523
Rose... Jack.

2705
02:52:48,857 --> 02:52:50,225
Listen to my love story.

2706
02:52:50,859 --> 02:52:52,694
After I fell head over heels
in love with her, I found out

2707
02:52:52,894 --> 02:52:54,729
she's already engaged.

2708
02:52:56,064 --> 02:52:58,933
After that, as we were sailing smoothly--

2709
02:52:59,100 --> 02:53:00,902
The ship hit an iceberg on the way.

2710
02:53:02,103 --> 02:53:03,338
How do you know that?

2711
02:53:03,438 --> 02:53:04,772
I'll wait outside, Master.

2712
02:53:05,440 --> 02:53:07,809
- Listen to my full epic love story.
- No need, it's okay, master.

2713
02:53:10,311 --> 02:53:13,915
<i>Since manipulation of boys into crimes
by anti-social elements was proved</i>

2714
02:53:13,982 --> 02:53:15,750
<i>- with the aid of proper evidence</i>
- Thank you, sir.

2715
02:53:15,850 --> 02:53:18,086
<i>that specific govt. reformatory
was shut down permanently.</i>

2716
02:53:18,186 --> 02:53:22,524
<i>Out of the 63 inmates, those above 18
were sent to Central Prison.</i>

2717
02:53:22,557 --> 02:53:26,561
<i>And those below 18 were sent
to other govt. reformatories.</i>

2718
02:53:26,895 --> 02:53:28,029
Your fingerprint over there.

2719
02:53:30,765 --> 02:53:31,599
Go inside.

2720
02:53:38,606 --> 02:53:40,141
What crime did you commit?

2721
02:53:41,643 --> 02:53:44,279
Baby face, partner.
Must be a gigolo.

2722
02:53:44,612 --> 02:53:46,548
Look at his face.
Like a parcel folded into four.

2723
02:53:46,648 --> 02:53:49,517
Juveniles of Nagercoil
in that Bhavani case.

2724
02:53:50,184 --> 02:53:52,186
I heard there were seven of them.
Only six are here.

2725
02:53:52,353 --> 02:53:54,856
Baby face is here.
Handsome face is missing.

2726
02:53:55,190 --> 02:53:56,224
Where is your master?

2727
02:53:56,724 --> 02:53:58,393
Must have been sent to Vellore jail.

2728
02:54:04,599 --> 02:54:05,600
It's even more convenient, partner.

2729
02:54:06,100 --> 02:54:08,269
We go to Vellore in ten days.
We'll finish him there.

2730
02:54:08,603 --> 02:54:11,105
Then we will meet your master in Vellore.

2731
02:54:14,142 --> 02:54:15,276
Transfer only after 10 days, huh?

2732
02:54:15,476 --> 02:54:17,312
- Are you here till then?
- Why?

2733
02:54:17,445 --> 02:54:19,013
Drag that 'beedi'
deep into your lungs.

2734
02:54:19,147 --> 02:54:20,815
This is the last 'beedi' you'll smoke.

2735
02:54:21,849 --> 02:54:23,151
Over dramatic punch line!

2736
02:54:23,484 --> 02:54:24,686
You're teaching me
about prisoners!

2737
02:54:25,987 --> 02:54:27,422
You might have seen
notorious prisoners

2738
02:54:27,522 --> 02:54:29,290
but guess who is coming now.

2739
02:54:29,390 --> 02:54:30,225
Master.

2740
02:54:30,391 --> 02:54:31,292
<i>Master coming!</i>

2741
02:54:31,392 --> 02:54:32,227
<i>Move aside!</i>

2742
02:54:37,265 --> 02:54:38,433
<i>Safe and safeguarded</i>

2743
02:55:05,226 --> 02:55:07,395
<i>The second our commander steps in
It's like an atom bomb exploding</i>

2744
02:55:22,644 --> 02:55:23,711
<i>Master coming!</i>

2745
02:55:23,811 --> 02:55:24,979
<i>Move aside!</i>

2746
02:55:36,057 --> 02:55:38,726
<i>Deliberately if you make trouble</i>

2747
02:55:39,060 --> 02:55:41,563
<i>It will boomerang on you centuple</i>

2748
02:55:42,030 --> 02:55:44,566
<i>If you jeer or sneer at us</i>

2749
02:55:44,933 --> 02:55:47,268
<i>Mind you, you'll be limbless</i>

2750
02:55:52,106 --> 02:55:53,141
<i>Oh, no!</i>

2751
02:55:57,645 --> 02:55:59,013
<i>Tell topsy turvy
Yell curvy scurvy</i>

2752
02:56:20,101 --> 02:56:22,604
<i>Tear them to tatters
Scare them to scatter</i>

2753
02:56:46,561 --> 02:56:47,395
<i>Oh, no!</i>

2754
02:57:19,894 --> 02:57:22,096
<i>Tear them to tatters
Scare them to scatter</i>

2755
02:57:32,273 --> 02:57:33,808
<i>Master coming!
Move aside</i>

